ible drops\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://safexfire.com/company-profile/\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Distributor slabs from 25 units; large factory and warehouse orders are usually quoted with installation and first-year AMC included\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Distributor margins are wide on ISI portable extinguishers — commonly 30–45% off list — with servicing and refilling as the recurring earner\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.2/5 — respected among fire consultants and safety officers for consistent ISI compliance and industrial availability, with less consumer brand recall than Ceasefire\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Safex\", \"Ceasefire\", \"Kanex\", \"Minimax\", \"Omex\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high on industrial, warehouse and institutional tenders in AP/Telangana, where ISI compliance at a competitive rate matters more than brand name\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"ISI-certified stored-pressure extinguishers built to IS 15683 with laboratory-tested MAP powder to IS 4308; MAP 90 available on request in place of the standard MAP 40 charge\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://safexfire.com/product/6kg-abc-portable-stored-pressure/\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"moderate\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"strong\", \"skyscrapers\": \"strong\", \"individual_houses\": \"moderate\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Distributor and project rates typically run 40–55% below the website list price; retailers commonly list the same 6 kg unit near ₹1,900–2,500\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:52:19'),(6,'newage-fire','NEW','Newage Fire Protection','brands/newage-fire/logo.png','[\"newagefireprotection.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/unit for extinguisher cabinets\", \"lowest\": 3500, \"highest\": 14000}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Fire-protection systems and hardware for industrial plants, high-rise buildings and infrastructure\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Marine, oil-tank and tunnel fire protection under class-society approvals\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Cabinets and boxes that house extinguishers, hoses and hydrant equipment\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"NewAge Fire Protection Industries Pvt. Ltd. (independent, Sion, Mumbai)\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.indiamart.com/newageireprotectionindustries/\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Star-rated export house with an intercontinental supply chain; NFPA member serving oil and gas, power, marine, tunnels, hangars, pharmaceutical and construction sectors\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://newagefireprotection.com/about-us/\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"Retail and rural channels\", \"rural\": \"weak\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"West India, from the Mumbai base\", \"balanced\": \"Andhra Pradesh and Telangana project market\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1961, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.indiamart.com/newageireprotectionindustries/\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"Low — an industrial systems brand with essentially no retail or consumer presence\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Hydrant lines, sprinkler systems, monitors and firefighting machines, foam systems, deluge and industrial valves, dry chemical powder systems, water mist systems, gaseous suppression, fire alarm and detection, fire hoses, cabinets and extinguisher boxes — the company does not manufacture portable fire extinguishers\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://newagefireprotection.com/product/extinguisher-box/\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Priced per project BOQ; cabinet quantities are usually tendered alongside hydrant and hose-box scope\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Channel margins are thin compared with branded extinguishers because supply is direct to EPC contractors\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.3/5 among fire consultants for hydrant and sprinkler hardware; not a name buyers associate with portable extinguishers\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"NewAge Fire Protection\", \"HD Fire Protect\", \"Padmini\", \"Minimax\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"High on large industrial and infrastructure fire-protection packages; irrelevant on portable-extinguisher purchases\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"ISO 9001:2015 certified; products approved by BIS, UL, FM, VdS, LPCB and GL, with published BIS certificates covering couplings and branch pipes, landing valves and water-foam monitors\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://newagefireprotection.com/approval-certifications/\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"moderate\