ia including Andhra Pradesh and Telangana\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1989, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.waaree.com/about-us\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high. Waaree is the brand a first-time household buyer in Andhra Pradesh or Telangana is most likely to have heard of, and its own online store sells single panels with a printed price, which removes the usual quotation guesswork.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Solar PV modules (Mono PERC, n-type TOPCon, bifacial dual-glass), EPC services, project development, rooftop solutions, solar water pumps and independent power production\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.waaree.com/upload/media/datasheet_bi_55_520_550_12_03012025_1768193543.pdf\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Pallet-quantity orders (roughly 30+ modules) usually attract a step discount; container-quantity orders are quoted per Wp and negotiated against the current cell price.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Typical channel margin on modules is thin — around 4-8% for a franchise dealer, with most of the installer\'s margin coming from structure, inverter and labour rather than the panel.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.4/5 typical among Indian rooftop EPC engineers — praised for availability and after-sales reach, occasionally marked down on price versus Chinese imports\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Waaree\", \"Adani Solar\", \"Vikram Solar\", \"Tata Power Solar\", \"RenewSys\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"First choice for most AP/Telangana rooftop EPC contractors: the widest franchise and dealer network in India means replacement panels and warranty claims are handled locally rather than through a distant factory.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Factories independently assessed by Black & Veatch; ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015 and ISO 45001:2018 certified manufacturing. Dual-glass construction with a 30-year power-output warranty is the strongest reliability signal in the mainstream Indian retail range.\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.waaree.com/upload/media/datasheet_bi_55_520_550_12_03012025_1768193543.pdf\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"weak\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project/MW-scale supply typically lands 15-25% below the single-panel shop price; the ₹11,499 retail figure for this model is a retail-with-GST rate, not a project rate.\", \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:52:27'),(8,'adani-solar','ADA','Adani Solar','brands/adani-solar/logo.png','[\"adanisolar.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/Wp\", \"lowest\": 19, \"highest\": 30}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Utility-scale and large commercial and industrial solar plants\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Tender and PSU work that requires domestic-content-requirement cells and modules\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Large rooftop installations on factories, warehouses, hospitals and institutional campuses\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Adani Group (solar PV manufacturing at Mundra through Mundra Solar PV Ltd / Mundra Solar Energy Ltd)\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanisolar.com/about-us\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"India\'s first and largest vertically integrated solar PV manufacturer — 4 GW cell and module capacity plus 2 GW ingot and wafer capacity at Mundra, over 10 GW of modules shipped to India and the USA\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanisolar.com/about-us\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"Small-ticket rural retail across India\", \"rural\": \"moderate\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"Gujarat, Rajasthan and the western utility-scale belt\", \"balanced\": \"South India including Andhra Pradesh and Telangana\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 2017, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanisolar.com/about-us\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"High on brand recognition thanks to the Adani name, but low on practical access — Adani sells through project channels rather than single-panel retail, so a household buyer usually meets it via an installer\'s quotation.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Monofacial and bifacial PV modules in TOPCon and Mono PERC, M10 and G12 footprints, 535-660 W power class at 21-22% module efficiency; also ingots, wafers and cells\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanisolar.com/about-us\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Container-quantity buying is the norm; pallet-quantity orders through a distributor attract a modest step discount, single panels almost none.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Distributor margins on Adani modules are thin — roughly 3-6% — because most volume moves on project contracts negotiated close to factory price.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.5/5 typical among Indian utility and C&I design engineers — rated highly for cell-to-module traceability and PVEL results, with lead time the usual complaint\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Waaree\", \"Adani Solar\", \"Vikram Solar\", \"Tata Power Solar\", \"Premier Energies\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Preferred by larger EPC contractors and by anyone building for a tender that specifies domestic cells, because Adani makes its own ingots, wafers and cells rather than importing them.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Only Indian module maker ranked a Kiwa PVEL Top Performer seven years running and a consistent Bloomberg Tier-1 manufacturer. The Gen-II TOPCon datasheet lists IEC 61215, IEC 61730, UL 61730, BIS, IEC 61853-1/2, IEC 62782, IEC 61701, IEC 60068-2-68 and IEC 62716 approvals.\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.adanisolar.com/-/media/Project/AdaniSolar/Downloads/pdf/newdatasheet1/Shine-TOPCon-G2G-modules-Gen-II.pdf\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"weak\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"strong\", \"skyscrapers\": \"strong\", \"individual_houses\": \"moderate\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Adani is priced as a project product: MW-scale supply is quoted per Wp and can sit 20-30% under any single-panel retail figure. Domestic-content (DCR) variants for subsidy-linked work carry a clear premium over non-DCR.\", \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:52:24'),(9,'vikram-solar','VIK','Vikram Solar','brands/vikram-solar/logo.png','[\"vikramsolar.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/Wp\", \"lowest\": 18, \"highest\": 28}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Commercial and industrial rooftop and ground-mounted solar plants\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Single-axis tracker installations — the frame carries dedicated tracking holes — and DCR-content supply for subsidy-linked schemes\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PARADEA-M10-540-565W-144-CELLS.pdf\"}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Utility-scale plants and institutional campus installations\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Vikram Solar Limited (formerly Vikram Solar Private Limited), CIN L18100WB2005PLC106448, Kolkata; promoter and Managing Director Gyanesh Chaudhary\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/company/\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Presence across 39 countries, over 10 GW of modules shipped and 1.41 GW of aggregate EPC capacity; one of India\'s largest module manufacturers by operational capacity as on 31 March 2025\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/company/\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"Rural retail across the Hindi belt\", \"rural\": \"moderate\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"East India (West Bengal and the Kolkata belt) and Tamil Nadu\", \"balanced\": \"South India including Andhra Pradesh and Telangana\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 2005, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/company/\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"Moderate. A first-time household buyer in Andhra Pradesh or Telangana is unlikely to name Vikram Solar unprompted, but installers introduce it as a credible alternative to Waaree at a similar price.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Crystalline PV modules across the Paradea (bifacial glass-glass), Somera, Hypersol and Prexos ranges in Mono PERC, n-type and HJT, plus solar EPC and O&M services\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PARADEA-M10-540-565W-144-CELLS.pdf\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Pallet quantity is 36 modules and container quantity 720, so pricing steps naturally at those breaks; container orders are quoted per Wp.\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.vikramsolar.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/PARADEA-M10-540-565W-144-CELLS.pdf\"}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Channel margin on modules is thin, roughly 4-7% for a distributor; installers make their money on structure, inverter and installation rather than on the panel.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.3/5 typical among Indian design engineers — respected for datasheet transparency and reliability testing, less visible than Waaree in the retail channel\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Waaree\", \"Adani Solar\", \"Vikram Solar\", \"Tata Power Solar\", \"Premier Energies\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Well regarded by C&I and utility EPC contractors, particularly where a DCR-content module is needed; less commonly stocked than Waaree by small AP/Telangana rooftop installers.\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"PVEL Top Performer model. Datasheet prints its Indian standard explicitly (IS 14286:2010 / IEC 61215:2005 and IS/IEC 61730 Parts 1 and 2), plus IEC 