abling and labour\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.1/5 (typical) — rated good value with strong India service reach; image quality a step below Hikvision and Dahua at the same price\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"CP PLUS\", \"Hikvision\", \"Dahua\", \"Godrej\", \"Honeywell\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana: the local \'made in AP\' brand with the widest distributor network in tier-2 and tier-3 towns\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Brand claims ISO 9001, ISO 14001, UL, CE, FCC and RoHS accreditation; HDCVI/analogue cameras carry a 24-month carry-in warranty under the AIL service policy; Made-in-India (Kadapa) production\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://cpplusworld.com/about\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"weak\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project and distributor pricing for 2.4 MP analogue cameras is 25–35% below marketplace rates; retail buyers pay close to dealer list\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-23 00:03:24'),(13,'kajaria','KAJ','Kajaria Ceramics','brands/kajaria/logo.svg','[\"kajariaceramics.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/sqft\", \"lowest\": 45, \"highest\": 260}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Residential floor tiling - living rooms, bedrooms and corridors in individual houses and apartments\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Countertops, staircase risers and lift-lobby cladding cut from the same 600x1200 mm module\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Wall cladding and feature walls in the same large format, and light-commercial floors such as showrooms and offices\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"None - Kajaria Ceramics Limited is an independent listed company (NSE/BSE), promoted by the Ashok Kajaria family\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"India\'s largest tile manufacturer; annual capacity 87.80 million sq. metres across nine plants including Srikalahasti (Andhra Pradesh) and Balanagar (Telangana), plus exports\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.kajariaceramics.com/about?tab=overview\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"North-East\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"Pan-India, with own plants in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana\", \"balanced\": \"South and West\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1985, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high. Kajaria is the name a first-time home builder in AP/Telangana already knows, so it is the safe default even without spec knowledge\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Glazed vitrified tiles, polished vitrified tiles, full-body vitrified tiles, gres tiles, ceramic wall and floor tiles, large slabs (Vitronite, The Ultima, UniTerra, Grestough, Kasamood, Duratech, DuRock), Gresbond tile adhesives, Kerovit faucets and sanitaryware\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.kajariaceramics.com/about?tab=overview\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Slab