ows the Johnson name from ceramic tiles\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Marbonite is the brand\'s fully vitrified flagship, and this Elite range is sold as a StainFree series - a low-maintenance polished surface; the Industrial Products and Natural Resources division has run its own ceramics R&D department (CTDC) since 1997\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.hrjohnsonindia.com/about-us\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"not applicable\", \"bridges\": \"not applicable\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"strong\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project rates through the Prism Johnson institutional desk usually run 12-20% under the retail counter rate; retail carries dealer margin, freight and breakage allowance\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-25 06:42:40'),(16,'saint-gobain','SGB','Saint-Gobain','brands/saint-gobain/logo.png','[\"in.saint-gobain-glass.com\", \"saint-gobain-glass.in\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/sqft\", \"lowest\": 45, \"highest\": 140}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Solar-control glazing for house and apartment windows, balconies and staircase glazing\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Toughened or laminated Sun Ban for doors, railings and canopies after processing to IS 2553\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Small commercial facades and shopfronts where a reflective tinted look is wanted without a DGU\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Compagnie 