ice software\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leica_Geosystems\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Institutional orders of three or more units typically attract 5-10% off plus bundled training; colleges and PSUs negotiate dealer-level pricing\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Dealer margins on manual total stations run about 8-15%, with calibration, service contracts and accessories adding recurring revenue\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.6/5 - the reference brand among Indian survey engineers for accuracy retention, optics and service back-up\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Leica Geosystems\", \"Topcon\", \"Trimble\", \"Sokkia\", \"South\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high on government and infrastructure tenders that specify \\\"Leica or equivalent\\\"; preferred where resale value and calibration traceability matter\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"FlexLine is marketed on durability and low total cost of ownership: IP66 body, MIL-STD-810G rain test, -20 to +50 C operation, quadruple-axis compensation and PinPoint EDM\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://leica-geosystems.com/-/media/files/leicageosystems/products/datasheets/leica%20flexline%20ts07%200221%20en-in%20lr.pdf\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"strong\", \"bridges\": \"strong\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"strong\", \"skyscrapers\": \"strong\", \"individual_houses\": \"moderate\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project or tender supply bundled 