le liquidity\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"IP66 magnesium-alloy body, IACS independent angle calibration, 14 h battery life and 500 m reflectorless EDM; every instrument is tested in dust and water chambers and for vibration, drop, temperature and humidity\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.topconpositioning.com/content/dam/topcon_digital_asset_hub/collateral/brochures/topcon_gm-50-series_7010-2251_enUS23broc.pdf\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"strong\", \"bridges\": \"moderate\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project kits (instrument, tripod, prism, pole, training) are quoted 10-15% above the bare-instrument price; retail buyers in district towns usually pay the listed dealer price\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-23 00:04:43'),(22,'philips','PHI','Philips (Signify)',NULL,'[\"lighting.philips.co.in\", \"in.shop.lighting.philips.com\", \"signify.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/piece (9 W B22 LED bulb)\", \"lowest\": 99, \"highest\": 180}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"General indoor lighting in homes — living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens and passages\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Rooms where glare and flicker matter — study desks and children\'s rooms — which is what the EyeComfort positioning is aimed at\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Offices, shops and hospitality spaces running on existing B22 holders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, 