, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.5/5 (typical) — the default benchmark other lamp brands are compared against\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Philips\", \"Havells\", \"Wipro\", \"Syska\", \"Bajaj\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"High. When a client specifies a brand by name for lamping, Philips is the name they say; contractors keep it for the rooms the owner will inspect\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"The reference brand for lamp quality in India. Ace Saver is the value tier — the pitch is EyeComfort (reduced glare and minimised flicker), no UV or IR in the beam, and consistent colour, rather than the deepest published spec sheet\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"moderate\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"strong\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Philips carries a visible price premium over Wipro and a modest one over Havells at single-piece retail; on project quantities the gap narrows because the brand discounts hard on carton lots\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:51:48'),(23,'havells','HAV','Havells','brands/havells/logo.svg','[\"havells.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/piece (9 W B22 LED bulb)\", \"lowest\": 70, \"highest\": 180}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"General indoor lighting in homes — living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens and passages\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Replacement lamping during handover of apartment projects, where a single model has to be fitted in hundreds of identical holders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Offices, shops, restaurants and hotel corridors on existing B22 holders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Havells India Limited — independent Indian listed company, headquartered in Noida; owns the Havells, Lloyd, Crabtree, Standard Electric, Reo and Promptec brands\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Havells\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Pan-India through a very deep electrical-dealer network; in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana it is stocked by almost every general electrical shop in Hyderabad, Vijayawada, Visakhapatnam and the district towns, plus Havells Galaxy exclusive stores\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"—\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"North and West India\", \"balanced\": \"South India including AP/Telangana\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1958, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"High. The brand is recognised from fan and switch advertising, so a first-time buyer picks it off the shelf without asking for specifications\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Domestic, commercial and industrial lighting including LED lamps; fans; home appliances; modular switches and wiring accessories; water heaters; domestic and industrial switchgear; cables and wires; induction motors and capacitors\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Havells\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Carton lots (typically 100 lamps) attract the deepest slab; 500+ lamp orders for an apartment handover are usually quoted at a flat per-lamp rate\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Roughly 20-30 % on LED lamps at the counter, thinner than on fans or switchgear because online pricing sets the ceiling\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.3/5 (typical) — rated for consistency of light output and low failure rate rather than lowest price\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Philips\", \"Havells\", \"Wipro\", \"Syska\", \"Bajaj\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"High. Electrical contractors on flats and villa projects default to Havells lamps because the same dealer supplies wires, MCBs and switches, so one bill covers the lot\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Publishes a full engineering spec sheet per lamp — efficacy, power factor, THD, surge and isolation withstand, switching cycles, F50 L70 life — which very few Indian lamp brands do. 4 kV surge protection and a 140-270 V withstand range make it a safe choice on unstable rural feeders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"weak\", \"bridges\": \"weak\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project supply of LED bulbs typically lands 25-40 % below printed MRP once a builder buys by the carton; single-piece retail in a Hyderabad shop sits near the online special price\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:51:48'),(24,'wipro','WIP','Wipro Lighting',NULL,'[\"wiproconsumerlighting.com\", \"wiprolighting.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/piece (9 W B22 LED bulb)\", \"lowest\": 65, \"highest\": 240}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"General indoor lighting in homes — bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens and passages\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Locations with poor supply quality, where the 100-300 V operating window and 400 V protection matter more than the last few lumens\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Small offices, shops and workshops running on existing B22 holders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Wipro Enterprises Private Limited — the 2013 demerger of Wipro Limited\'s non-IT businesses, predominantly owned by Azim Premji, his associates and Premji family charitable trusts; lighting is one of its sectors\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wipro_Enterprises\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Pan-India, with a genuine second-tier presence in South India where Wipro\'s Bangalore base gives it dealer depth; in AP and Telangana it is stocked widely in electrical shops and is strong on e-commerce and its own D2C store\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"North-East\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"South India\", \"balanced\": \"West and North India\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 2013, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wipro_Enterprises\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"High. The Wipro name carries trust from consumer care products, so a first-time buyer accepts it without checking the specification\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Fast-moving consumer goods, lighting, hydraulic cylinders, industrial automation, 3D printing, aerospace component manufacturing and industrial water treatment; in lighting, the Garnet consumer range of LED bulbs, battens, panels and emergency lamps alongside professional luminaires under Wipro Lighting\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wipro_Enterprises\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Carton and multi-carton slabs are the usual mechanism; combination orders with battens and panels get the better rate\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Roughly 20-30 % at the counter on LED bulbs, with the brand\'s own online pricing capping what a dealer can hold\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.1/5 (typical) — well regarded for surviving voltage fluctuation, less so for published photometric detail\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"Philips\", \"Havells\", \"Wipro\", \"Syska\", \"Bajaj\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Moderate to high. Often the value pick when a contractor wants a national brand at a lower landed cost than Philips or Havells\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Wipro sells the Garnet range on electrical robustness rather than photometrics: LM-80 tested LEDs so brightness holds over life, a 240° beam for wide glare-free spread, a 100-300 V AC operating window and 400 V high-voltage plus 4 kV surge protection — a good fit for feeders that swing\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"weak\", \"bridges\": \"weak\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"weak\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Wipro\'s own D2C store price for the 9 W bulb sits far below printed MRP, which sets a low reference for retail; project supply is negotiated per carton and lands lower again\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:31','2026-08-22 07:51:48'),(25,'ultratech','ULT','UltraTech Cement','brands/ultratech/logo.png','[\"ultratechcement.com\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/bag\", \"lowest\": 380, \"highest\": 460}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"General residential construction — foundation, column, beam and slab concrete\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Marine and hydraulic structures, dams, underground basements and sewerage works where sulphate and chloride resistance matters\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ultratechcement.com/for-homebuilders/products/overview/ppc\"}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Brick and block masonry, internal and external wall plastering\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Aditya Birla Group, held through Grasim Industries (56.11%)\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UltraTech_Cement\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Pan-India; 152.70 MTPA installed capacity; largest grey cement, RMC and white cement manufacturer in India and fifth largest in the world\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UltraTech_Cement\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"—\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"Pan-India\", \"balanced\": \"South and West\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1983, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UltraTech_Cement\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"Very high — the most recognised cement name among first-time individual house builders; the brand is often used as a generic word for cement\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Grey cement (OPC, PPC, PSC, composite), white cement, ready-mix concrete and building products\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UltraTech_Cement\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Slab-based discounts usually start around 100 bags; full-truckload (roughly 400–600 bags) attracts the best rate plus freight absorption\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Retail dealer margin on a 50 kg bag is typically ₹12–25, thinner than for smaller brands because volumes are high and rotation is fast\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.5/5 (typical)\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"UltraTech\", \"ACC\", \"Ambuja\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"First choice for contractors and developers in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana; specified by default on most RCC work where the client has not named a brand\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Consistent bag-to-bag quality is UltraTech\'s main reputational asset in South India; PPC route uses high-reactive-silica fly ash and high-purity gypsum for low permeability and steel protection\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"strong\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"strong\", \"dams_metro\": \"strong\", \"skyscrapers\": \"strong\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project/bulk supply typically lands ₹25–45 per bag below the retail counter rate for orders above roughly 500 bags with direct plant despatch\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:32','2026-08-22 06:04:20'),(26,'acc','ACC','ACC',NULL,'[\"acclimited.com\", \"acchelp.in\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/bag\", \"lowest\": 350, \"highest\": 440}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Concrete for foundations, beams and columns in individual house construction\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acchelp.in/all-products/cement/acc-suraksha-power-cement\"}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Long-term-strength civil work such as road and bridge foundations where dense, low-permeability concrete is wanted\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Brick masonry, wall plastering and slab casting\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acchelp.in/all-products/cement/acc-suraksha-power-cement\"}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Adani Group (56.69% as of 2025); ACC is a subsidiary of Ambuja Cements following the 15 May 2022 acquisition of Holcim\'s stake\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ACC_Limited\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Pan-India with a long-established dealer network; part of the Adani cement platform that also includes Ambuja, Penna, Sanghi, Orient and Jaypee Cement\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ambuja_Cements\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"—\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"West, East and Central India\", \"balanced\": \"South\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1936, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ACC_Limited\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"High — one of the oldest and most familiar cement names in India, frequently chosen by first-time house builders on reputation alone\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Grey cement (PPC, OPC, composite), ready-mixed concrete and concrete solutions; retail lines include Suraksha, Suraksha Power, Gold and Concrete+\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Volume slabs generally begin around 100 bags; site-delivered truckload orders get the best landed rate\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Retail dealer margin on a 50 kg bag is typically ₹15–28, a little wider than UltraTech\'s to defend shelf space\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.3/5 (typical)\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"UltraTech\", \"ACC\", \"Ambuja\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Strong with masons and small contractors for plaster and masonry work; a long-trusted name where the brand predates most competitors in the market\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"ACC\'s pitch is uniform particle size distribution, specially processed reactive silica and batch-by-batch testing, giving dense concrete with lower heat of hydration\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.acchelp.in/all-products/cement/acc-suraksha-power-cement\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"strong\", \"bridges\": \"strong\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project supply typically runs ₹20–40 per bag under the retail counter rate once volumes cross a full truckload\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:32','2026-08-22 06:04:20'),(27,'ambuja','AMB','Ambuja Cements','brands/ambuja/logo.png','[\"ambujacement.com\", \"ambujahelp.in\"]','{\"price_band\": {\"value\": {\"unit\": \"₹/bag\", \"lowest\": 355, \"highest\": 445}, \"provenance\": \"estimated\", \"source_url\": null}, \"primary_use\": {\"value\": \"Roof slab casting and foundation concrete for individual houses, especially in heavy-rainfall regions\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ambujahelp.in/all-products/ambuja-plus\"}, \"special_use\": {\"value\": \"Water-facing and leak-prone elements such as terraces, sunken slabs and parapets, where the SPE-densified matrix resists seepage\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"secondary_use\": {\"value\": \"Beams and columns, brick masonry and wall plastering\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ambujahelp.in/all-products/ambuja-plus\"}, \"parent_company\": {\"value\": \"Adani Group (63.2%), following the 15 May 2022 acquisition of Holcim\'s stake in Ambuja Cements and ACC for US$10.5 billion\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ambuja_Cements\"}, \"market_coverage\": {\"value\": \"Pan-India, with plants including Darlaghat (Himachal Pradesh) and Howrah (West Bengal); heads the Adani cement platform whose subsidiaries include ACC, Penna Cement, Sanghi Industries, Orient Cement and Jaypee Cement\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ambuja_Cements\"}, \"region_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"weak\": \"—\", \"rural\": \"strong\", \"urban\": \"strong\", \"strong\": \"West and North India\", \"balanced\": \"South and East\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"year_established\": {\"value\": 1983, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ambuja_Cements\"}, \"novice_preference\": {\"value\": \"High — long-running consumer advertising around strength and leak-proofing makes it an easy pick for individual house builders\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"product_portfolio\": {\"value\": \"Cement and clinker for domestic and export markets; retail lines include Ambuja Cement (OPC and PPC), Ambuja Plus, Kawach, Compocem, Cool Walls, Buildcem, Powercem, Railcem and Purasand\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ambujahelp.in/flagship-products/ambuja-cement\"}, \"bulk_discount_note\": {\"value\": \"Volume slabs generally start around 100 bags; full-truckload orders attract the best landed rate including freight support\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"dealer_margin_note\": {\"value\": \"Retail dealer margin on a 50 kg bag is typically ₹15–28\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"engineer_user_rating\": {\"value\": \"4.3/5 (typical)\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"top_preference_order\": {\"value\": [\"UltraTech\", \"ACC\", \"Ambuja\"], \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"contractor_preference\": {\"value\": \"Well regarded by contractors for roof slabs and water-facing work; the leak-resistance positioning carries real weight in high-rainfall coastal districts\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"quality_strength_note\": {\"value\": \"Ambuja\'s technical claim rests on SPE (Special Performance Enhancer) technology, which extracts the silicate gel present in the cement to give denser, less permeable concrete\", \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": \"https://www.ambujahelp.in/all-products/ambuja-plus\"}, \"building_type_strengths\": {\"value\": {\"roads\": \"moderate\", \"bridges\": \"moderate\", \"low_rise\": \"strong\", \"mid_rise\": \"strong\", \"high_rise\": \"moderate\", \"dams_metro\": \"moderate\", \"skyscrapers\": \"moderate\", \"individual_houses\": \"strong\"}, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, \"project_vs_retail_cost_note\": {\"value\": \"Project supply typically runs ₹20–40 per bag under the retail counter rate at truckload volumes with direct despatch\", \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}}','2026-08-22 06:03:32','2026-08-22 06:04:20');
