 lamp',240.00,65.00,'fetched','https://www.wiproconsumerlighting.com/products/garnet/led-bulb/garnet-9w-led-bulb','MRP ₹240 and store price ₹65 for variant N96101 (B22 / Cool White / 9 W) read from the Wipro Consumer Lighting store\'s public product feed on 22 Aug 2026; Moglix lists the same ₹240 MRP for the 9 W Garnet.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',12.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Wipro Garnet 9 W B22 LED bulb, 900 lm cool day white 6500 K, 240° spread, works from 100-300 V AC with 4 kV surge protection.','## What it is\n\nThe Wipro Garnet 9 W B22 Cool Day White LED bulb (catalogue number N96101) is the 9-watt bayonet-cap node of Wipro\'s mainstream Garnet household LED range. It is a round A-shape lamp in a polycarbonate body with a frosted diffuser and a B22 cap, and it puts out 900 lumens of 6500 K cool day white — about 100 lumens per watt.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nEveryday indoor lighting: bedrooms, living rooms, kitchens, passages, and small offices and shops running on existing B22 holders. Wipro sells it for home and office use, and the carton restricts it to indoor applications. At 900 lm it is a like-for-like replacement for an ordinary incandescent bulb in the same holder.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nRated 220-240 V AC at 50 Hz, the lamp is built around a wide operating window: it keeps running from 100 V to 300 V AC, carries 400 V high-voltage protection and 4 kV of surge protection, which is the reason to reach for it on a feeder that swings. The LEDs are LM-80 tested so the brightness holds over the lamp\'s life, and the 240° beam gives a wide, glare-free spread rather than a narrow pool. The carton declares base cap B22, IS 16102 (Part 1) with the BIS standard mark, no UV or IR radiation, non-dimmable operation, and net quantity 1 N. The lamp is made in India by Wipro Enterprises (P) Ltd.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nPush the cap into the B22 holder and twist a quarter turn. It is not dimmable, so keep it off dimmer and regulator circuits. Do not fit it in a totally enclosed fixture — the carton says so explicitly, and a sealed fitting traps the heat the lamp needs to shed. Indoor use only; it has no declared IP rating and is not intended for open verandas or outdoor fittings. Being polycarbonate rather than glass it will survive a knock that would shatter a filament bulb.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne lamp in a printed Garnet carton, net quantity 1 N, with the catalogue number, base cap, voltage, IS standard, BIS mark and MRP block printed on the declaration panel. Wipro\'s usual lamp warranty is one year from date of purchase.','[{\"key\": \"base_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Base type\", \"value\": \"B22\"}, {\"key\": \"luminous_intensity\", \"unit\": \"cd\", \"label\": \"Luminous intensity\", \"value\": \"95.5 cd\"}, {\"key\": \"colour_temperature\", \"unit\": \"K\", \"label\": \"Colour temperature\", \"value\": \"6,500 K\"}, {\"key\": \"wattage\", \"unit\": \"W\", \"label\": \"Wattage\", \"value\": \"9 W\"}, {\"key\": \"colour_rendering_index\", \"unit\": \"Ra\", \"label\": \"Colour rendering index\", \"value\": \"80 Ra\"}, {\"key\": \"beam_angle\", \"unit\": \"°\", \"label\": \"Beam angle\", \"value\": \"240 °\"}, {\"key\": \"operating_life\", \"unit\": \"h\", \"label\": \"Operating life\", \"value\": \"15,000 h\"}, {\"key\": \"luminous_flux\", \"unit\": \"lm\", \"label\": \"Luminous flux\", \"value\": \"900 lm\"}]','{\"total\": 95, \"filled\": 95, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"N96101\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"base_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Base type\", \"value\": \"B22\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"verified\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"bulb_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Bulb type\", \"valu