here is no separate LED term\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"warranty_coverage\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Warranty coverage\", \"value\": \"Manufacturing defects only; excludes use in fully enclosed fittings, outdoor use and physical breakage\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"warranty_claim_procedure\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Warranty claim procedure\", \"value\": \"Through the seller or Philips India consumer care (1800 102 2929) with the invoice and the failed lamp\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Warranty & service\", \"importance\": 5}], \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 28, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 66}}','{\"title\": \"Philips Ace Saver 9W B22 LED Bulb 806lm 6500K\", \"keywords\": [\"philips 9w led bulb\", \"philips ace saver b22\", \"9 watt led bulb b22\", \"philips 929001198414\", \"cool day light led bulb 6500k\", \"led bulb price hyderabad\", \"philips led bulb\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"फिलिप्स 9 वाट एलईडी बल्ब\", \"एस सेवर बल्ब\", \"बी22 एलईडी बल्ब\", \"कूल डे लाइट बल्ब 6500K\", \"एलईडी बल्ब कीमत\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"ఫిలిప్స్ 9 వాట్ ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు\", \"ఏస్ సేవర్ బల్బు\", \"బి22 ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు\", \"కూల్ డే లైట్ బల్బు\", \"ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు ధర\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"base_type\", \"luminous_flux\", \"luminous_intensity\", \"colour_temperature\", \"colour_rendering_index\", \"beam_angle\", \"wattage\", \"operating_life\"], \"meta_description\": \"Philips Ace Saver 9 W B22 cool day light LED bulb: 806 lm, 6500 K, EyeComfort low-glare light, no UV or IR, 220-240 V, polycarbonate body, made in India.\"}','skus/1b/BUL-PHI-ACESAVER9WB22/img/1-card.webp','LNRMb%ja_2-;-pV@W=oz~pxuNHxu',4.3,'https://www.lighting.philips.co.in/consumer/led-lights/led-bulbs','{\"total\": 95, \"filled\": 95, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 0, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.098Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 28, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 66}}','2026-08-22 07:51:48','2026-08-25 09:18:51',8,NULL),(15,15,'BUL-HAV-LEDPLUS9WB22','9 W · B22 · 6500 K cool day light · single lamp',150.00,70.00,'fetched','https://havells.com/lighting/led-lamps/led-plus-9-w-b22-cdl-lamp-v7-lhldddbnl5r009.html','MRP ₹150 and special price ₹70 (inclusive of all taxes) as listed on havells.com on 22 Aug 2026.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',12.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Havells 9 W B22 LED bulb, 849 lm cool day light 6500 K, 15,000 h life, 4 kV surge protection, works from 140-270 V. BEE 1 Star.','## What it is\n\nThe Havells LED Plus 9 W B22 CDL Lamp V7 (model LHLDDDBNL5R009) is a self-ballasted LED bulb with a round polycarbonate body, an opal polycarbonate diffuser and a B22 bayonet cap — the ordinary pin-type holder used in almost every Indian house. It draws 9 W and puts out 849 lumens of 6500 K cool day light, which works out to 94.44 lm/W and earns it a BEE 1 Star label. Havells makes it in India and sells it under its Adore+ LED lamp identity.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nGeneral indoor lighting: living rooms and bedrooms first, and equally at home in a corporate office, a shop, a restaurant or a hotel corridor. At 849 lm it replaces a roughly 57 W incandescent bulb one-for-one in the same holder, so it is the straightforward swap when an old bulb fails or when a new flat is being lamped up.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nIt runs on 220-240 V AC at 50 Hz and draws 0.05 A, with a power factor of at least 0.90 and total harmonic distortion below 33 %. The point that matters on an unstable feeder is the withstand range: the lamp keeps working from 140 V to 270 V, starts from 100 V, carries 4 kV of in-built surge protection and 3.75 kV of isolation. The colour rendering index is 80 or better, start-up is under two seconds, and there is no flicker visible at rated voltage and no UV or IR in the beam. Rated life is 15,000 hours to the F50 L70 code with 7,500 switching cycles. The lamp measures 60 mm across and 113 mm tall, weighs 48 g net, and is rated IP20 for ambient temperatures of 0-35 °C.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nPush the cap into the B22 holder and twist a quarter turn; any orientation is fine. It is not dimmable, so keep it off dimmer and regulator circuits. Do not fit it inside a fully enclosed luminaire — the IP20 rating and the 0-35 °C ambient limit both assume the lamp can shed its heat into open air. Being polycarbonate rather than glass, it survives a knock that would shatter a filament bulb.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne lamp in a printed carton, net contents 1 N, carton 65 × 60 × 120 mm. Trade packing is a master box of 316 × 316 × 250 mm weighing 3.14 kg. The lamp carries a one-year Havells warranty.','[{\"key\": \"base_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Base type\", \"value\": \"B22\"}, {\"key\": \"luminous_intensity\", \"unit\": \"cd\", \"label\": \"Luminous intensity\", \"value\": \"100.7 cd\"}, {\"key\": \"colour_temperature\", \"unit\": \"K\", \"label\": \"Colour temperature\", \"value\": \"6,500 K\"}, {\"key\": \"wattage\", \"unit\": \"W\", \"label\": \"Wattage\", \"value\": \"9 W\"}, {\"key\": \"colour_rendering_index\", \"unit\": \"Ra\", \"label\": \"Colour rendering index\", \"value\": \"80 Ra\"}, {\"key\": \"beam_angle\", \"unit\": \"°\", \"label\": \"Beam angle\", \"value\": \"220 °\"}, {\"key\": \"operating_life\", \"unit\": \"h\", \"label\": \"Operating life\", \"value\": \"15,000 h\"}, {\"key\": \"luminous_flux\", \"unit\": \"lm\", \"label\": \"Luminous flux\", \"value\": \"849 lm\"}]','{\"total\": 95, \"filled\": 95, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"LHLDDDBNL5R009\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"