s_te\": [\"హెవెల్స్ 9 వాట్ ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు\", \"బి22 ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు\", \"కూల్ డే లైట్ బల్బు\", \"ఎల్ఈడీ బల్బు ధర\", \"9 వాట్ బల్బు\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"base_type\", \"luminous_flux\", \"luminous_intensity\", \"colour_temperature\", \"colour_rendering_index\", \"beam_angle\", \"wattage\", \"operating_life\"], \"meta_description\": \"Havells LED Plus 9 W B22 cool day light bulb: 849 lm, 6500 K, 94.44 lm/W, 15,000 h life, 4 kV surge protection, 140-270 V range, BEE 1 Star, 1 yr warranty.\"}','skus/65/BUL-HAV-LEDPLUS9WB22/img/1-card.webp','LISigQ-;~q?b~qj[D%ayj[fQj[fQ',4.3,'https://havells.com/lighting/led-lamps/led-plus-9-w-b22-cdl-lamp-v7-lhldddbnl5r009.html','{\"total\": 95, \"filled\": 95, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 0, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.114Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 59, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 35}}','2026-08-22 07:51:48','2026-08-25 09:18:51',8,NULL),(16,16,'EPX-FOS-CONBEXTRAEP10','1 litre pack (base + hardener)',1450.00,1295.00,'estimated',NULL,'Fosroc publishes no MRP. Estimated from Indian distributor quotes of ₹750–1,650/kg and a ₹1,450 per-pack quote (Noida) seen on IndiaMART listings in August 2026; ±15 %. The Amazon.in listing for the 1 LTR pack (B097TWV3WR) returned HTTP 500 and could not ','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'kit',1.000,'in_stock','Fosroc Conbextra EP10 solvent-free epoxy resin free-flow grout, 1 litre pack. 80 MPa at 7 days, fills 0.25-10 mm gaps.','## What it is\n\nConbextra EP10 is Fosroc\'s high-strength epoxy resin grout: a solvent-free, all-liquid two-can system of base and hardener, supplied in the correct proportions for whole-pack mixing on site. It flows freely into gaps of 0.25 to 10 mm and cures to a non-shrink mass that keeps full surface-to-surface contact with both the foundation and the plate above it.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nUnderplate grouting to substantial structural elements, and base-plate grouting where dynamic loads are the problem — turbines, reciprocating machinery, crane and transporter rails. It is written into heavy industrial specifications for steelworks, refineries, chemical plants and electroplating works, where chemical spillage would attack a cementitious grout. The same pack doubles as a low-viscosity injection resin for filling cracks, honeycombs and cavities in high-strength concrete from 0.25 mm upward.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nCompressive strength reaches 45 MPa at one day, 60 MPa at three days and 80 MPa at seven days — the figure Fosroc writes into its own specification clause. Tensile strength is 20 MPa and flexural strength 40 MPa at seven days. Mixed density is about 1.05 kg/L and pot life is 50 minutes at 27 °C. It conforms to BS EN 1504-3 Class R4 and BS EN 1504-6 for anchoring of reinforcing steel bar; no BIS mark is declared. Shelf life is 12 months below 35 °C. The product is suitable for structural use and resists repetitive dynamic loading with low creep under sustained load.\n\n## Application notes\n\nThe foundation must be free of oil, grease and loose material, with laitance cut back to a sound base and bolt pockets blown clean. Take steel base plates to a bright finish (SA 2½) and prime with Nitoprime 25 if placement will be delayed. Formwork must be leak-proof — this is a free-flow grout. Pour the whole hardener can into the base, mix two to three minutes to a uniform colour, then pour from one side through a feeding hopper, holding a continuous hydrostatic head so no air is trapped. For injection work, drill 8-10 mm holes, fix nipples with epoxy putty and inject until resin emerges from the next nipple. Above 35 °C, keep material and equipment cool and avoid midday sun. Do not place in unrestrained situations.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne 1 litre pack: base container plus separate hardener can, pre-proportioned for whole-pack mixing.','[{\"key\": \"epoxy_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Epoxy system type\", \"value\": \"Free-flow grout\"}, {\"key\": \"compressive_strength_mpa\", \"unit\": \"MPa\", \"label\": \"Compressive strength\", \"value\": \"80 MPa\"}, {\"key\": \"bond_strength_concrete_mpa\", \"unit\": \"MPa\", \"label\": \"Bond strength to concrete\", \"value\": \"12 MPa\"}, {\"key\": \"pot_life_min\", \"unit\": \"min\", \"label\": \"Pot life at 30 °C\", \"value\": \"50 min\"}, {\"key\": \"full_cure_time_days\", \"unit\": \"days\", \"label\": \"Full cure time\", \"value\": \"7 days\"}, {\"key\": \"coverage\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Coverage / yield\", \"value\": \"One 1 litre pack yields about 1 litre of mixed grout — roughly 1 m² of a 1 mm gap, or 0.1 m² of a 10 mm gap\"}, {\"key\": \"pack_size_kg\", \"unit\": \"kg\", \"label\": \"Kit / pack size\", \"value\": \"1.05 kg\"}, {\"key\": \"application_thickness_mm\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Application thickness per layer\", \"value\": \"Gap thickness 0.25 mm to 10 mm; injectable into cracks and construction joints from 0.25 mm to 9 mm\"}]','{\"total\": 49, \"filled\": 48, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"epoxy_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Epoxy system type\", \"value\": \"Free-flow grout\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"application_form\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Consistency / form\", \"value\": \"Free-flowing liquid\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model / product code\", \"value\": \"Conbextra EP10\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"solvent_free\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Solvent free\", \"value\": true, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"boolean\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"series\", \"unit\": null, \"l