e full-scale use; the company does not assume liability for consequential damage from unsatisfactory results\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Warranty & service\", \"importance\": 5}], \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 31, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 18}}','{\"title\": \"Dr. Fixit Epoxy Injection Grout 3 kg | Crack Repair\", \"keywords\": [\"dr fixit epoxy injection grout\", \"epoxy crack filler concrete\", \"structural crack injection resin\", \"dr fixit 206 price\", \"pidilite epoxy grout\", \"concrete crack repair epoxy india\", \"epoxy injection grout hyderabad\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"डॉ फिक्सिट एपॉक्सी ग्राउट\", \"दरार भरने वाला एपॉक्सी\", \"कंक्रीट क्रैक रिपेयर\", \"इंजेक्शन ग्राउट कीमत\", \"एपॉक्सी क्रैक फिलर\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"డాక్టర్ ఫిక్సిట్ ఎపాక్సీ\", \"పగుళ్ల ఎపాక్సీ గ్రౌట్\", \"కాంక్రీట్ పగుళ్ల మరమ్మతు\", \"ఇంజెక్షన్ గ్రౌట్ ధర\", \"ఎపాక్సీ క్రాక్ ఫిల్లర్\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"epoxy_type\", \"compressive_strength_mpa\", \"bond_strength_concrete_mpa\", \"pot_life_min\", \"full_cure_time_days\", \"application_thickness_mm\", \"coverage\", \"pack_size_kg\"], \"meta_description\": \"Dr. Fixit Epoxy Injection Grout 206, 3 kg pack. Low-viscosity two-part epoxy for structural crack injection. 70 MPa, BS 6319. AP & Telangana delivery.\"}','skus/a4/EPX-PID-EPOXYINJGROUT/img/1-card.webp','LXRyjI%2_N%g%Mj[jaf6%Mj[NGWV',4.3,'https://www.drfixit.co.in/resources/library/technical-data/large-projects/206-dr-fixit-epoxy-injection-grout','{\"total\": 49, \"filled\": 49, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 1, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.142Z\", \"placeholders\": 2, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 31, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 18}}','2026-08-22 07:52:07','2026-08-25 09:18:51',1,NULL),(18,18,'EPX-SIK-SIKADUR31IN','6 kg pre-batched unit (Part A 4 kg + Part B 2 kg)',2450.00,2190.00,'estimated',NULL,'Sika publishes no MRP for Sikadur-31 IN. Estimated from Indian distributor quotes of ₹345–425/kg seen on IndiaMART listings in August 2026 (≈ ₹2,070–2,550 for the 6 kg unit); ±10 %. Sika India\'s own storefront lists a \'Sikadur-31, 6 kg x 2\' pack at ₹1,639','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'kit',1.000,'in_stock','Sikadur-31 IN two-part thixotropic structural epoxy adhesive and repair mortar, 6 kg pre-batched unit. Mix 2:1, 40 min pot life.','## What it is\n\nSikadur-31 IN is Sika\'s India formulation of its best-known structural epoxy: a solvent-free, moisture-tolerant, thixotropic two-part adhesive and repair mortar based on epoxy resin with special fillers. It is supplied as a factory pre-batched unit — Part A resin and Part B hardener in different colours, so a streak-free grey mix is your own proof that the blend is right. Rated for use between +10 °C and +40 °C, it is built for Indian site temperatures rather than European ones.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nThree jobs in one pack. As a structural adhesive it bonds concrete elements, hard natural stone, ceramics, fibre cement, mortar, brick, block and masonry, steel, iron, aluminium, wood, polyester, epoxy and glass. As a fast-setting repair mortar it rebuilds corners, edges, joint arises and fills holes and voids. As a filler it seals rigid joints and non-moving cracks. It is suitable for structural use, indoors and out.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nMix Part A to Part B at 2:1 by weight and you get roughly 40 minutes of pot life at +30 °C. Mixed density is 1.80 kg/L and the paste is non-sag up to 10 mm on a vertical face, so it stays where you put it overhead. Cured strengths reach 55 MPa in compression and 20 MPa in flexure at seven days, with tensile strength of 8 MPa and a tensile adhesion strength to concrete of 10 MPa — a bond that fails in the concrete, not the glue line. Build up to 30 mm in a single layer. Conformity is declared to ASTM C 881 Type I, Grade 3, Class B+C; no BIS mark is claimed. Shelf life is 12 months.\n\n## Application notes\n\nConcrete must be at least 28 days old, sound, clean, and dry or matt damp — never under standing water. Prepare mechanically by blasting, scabbling or grinding to an open gripping profile and vacuum off all dust; take steel to bright metal. Mix Part A briefly, add Part B, and mix at most 300 rpm for three minutes plus a further minute after decanting. Apply to both faces with a spatula or trowel. Keep the substrate 3 °C above dew point and support heavy components until cure. Consumption is about 2.0 kg/m² per mm of thickness.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne 6 kg pre-batched unit: Part A resin 4 kg and Part B hardener 2 kg. Also stocked in 3 kg and 30 kg units.','[{\"key\": \"epoxy_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Epoxy system type\", \"value\": \"Structural adhesive\"}, {\"key\": \"compressive_strength_mpa\", \"unit\": \"MPa\", \"label\": \"Compressive strength\", \"value\": \"55 MPa\"}, {\"key\": \"bond_strength_concrete_mpa\", \"unit\": \"MPa\", \"label\": \"Bond strength to concrete\", \"value\": \"10 MPa\"}, {\"key\": \"pot_life_min\", \"unit\": \"min\", \"label\": \"Pot life at 30 °C\", \"value\": \"40 min\"}, {\"key\": \"full_cure_time_days\", \"unit\": \"days\", \"label\": \"Full cure time\", \"value\": \"7 days\"}, {\"key\": \"coverage\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Coverage / yield\", \"value\": \"Approximately 2.0 kg per m² for every 1 mm of layer thickness; a 6 kg unit covers about 3 m² at 1 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"pack_size_kg\", \"unit\": \"kg\", \"label\": \"Kit / pack size\", \"value\": \"6 kg\"}, {\"key\": \"application_thickness_mm\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Application thickness per layer\", \"value\": \"30 mm maximum per layer; thicker sections built up in successive 30 mm layers once the previous layer has hardened\"}]','{\"total\": 49, \"filled\": 47, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"epoxy_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Epoxy system type\", \"value\": \"Structural adhesive\", \"com