nance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 30, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 17}}','{\"title\": \"Sika Sikadur-31 IN Epoxy Adhesive 6 kg | ASTM C 881\", \"keywords\": [\"sikadur 31 in\", \"sika epoxy adhesive\", \"structural epoxy adhesive india\", \"epoxy repair mortar\", \"concrete bonding epoxy\", \"sikadur 31 price\", \"epoxy adhesive hyderabad\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"सिका एपॉक्सी\", \"सिकाडुर 31\", \"एपॉक्सी एडहेसिव\", \"कंक्रीट रिपेयर एपॉक्सी\", \"स्ट्रक्चरल एपॉक्सी कीमत\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"సికా ఎపాక్సీ\", \"సికాడూర్ 31\", \"ఎపాక్సీ అంటుకునే పదార్థం\", \"కాంక్రీట్ మరమ్మతు ఎపాక్సీ\", \"నిర్మాణ ఎపాక్సీ ధర\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"epoxy_type\", \"compressive_strength_mpa\", \"bond_strength_concrete_mpa\", \"pot_life_min\", \"full_cure_time_days\", \"application_thickness_mm\", \"coverage\", \"pack_size_kg\"], \"meta_description\": \"Sikadur-31 IN two-part thixotropic structural epoxy adhesive and repair mortar, 6 kg unit. 2:1 mix, 40 min pot life, 55 MPa. Delivered in AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/f1/EPX-SIK-SIKADUR31IN/img/1-card.webp','LPR3TW-;%M%M~qt7M{WB_3ofRjj[',4.3,'https://ind.sika.com/en/construction/concrete-repair/bonding-primers/sikadur-31-in.html','{\"total\": 49, \"filled\": 47, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 1, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.157Z\", \"placeholders\": 2, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 30, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 17}}','2026-08-22 07:52:07','2026-08-25 09:18:51',1,NULL),(19,19,'FIR-CEA-MAP90-4KG','4 kg stored pressure',10230.00,10230.00,'fetched','https://www.ceasefireonlineshop.com/products/abc-powder-map90-4kg','Listed price on the official Ceasefire online shop for CF-001144 (dual-certified IS 15683 + EN 3 / PED unit). Trade and project pricing in Hyderabad is materially lower.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Ceasefire 4 kg ABC MAP 90 stored-pressure extinguisher. 4A 144B rating, 15 bar working pressure, IS 15683 and EN 3 certified.','## What it is\n\nThe Ceasefire ABC Powder MAP 90 4 kg (product code CF-001144) is a stored-pressure portable fire extinguisher charged with 90% mono ammonium phosphate dry chemical powder. The shell is a two-piece welded deep-drawn steel cylinder, 140 mm across and 445 mm tall, finished in epoxy-polyester powder coating and fitted with a forged brass squeeze-grip valve, a pressure gauge and a discharge hose. Charged, the unit weighs about 6.5 kg.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nOne extinguisher covers Class A (wood, paper, textiles), Class B (flammable liquids), Class C (flammable gases) and electrically started fires, so the user does not have to identify the fire class before acting. That makes it the default first-aid appliance for homes, apartments, offices, shops and showrooms, godowns, workshops, electrical panel rooms and cars — roughly 55 m² of protected floor area per unit.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nIt carries a 4A 144B rating under IS 15683 and 21A 144B under EN 3, works at 15 bar and is hydraulically tested at 35 bar. Rated service range is −30 °C to 60 °C, so it stays usable in an unventilated Telangana warehouse in May. Throw range is over 2 m and the charge empties in roughly 15 seconds of continuous discharge. Beyond the BIS certification to IS 15683, this range is dual-certified to EN 3 and PED and carries LPCB approval, the BSI Kitemark and CE marking. The manufacturer warranty runs 120 months.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nFollow IS 2190 for siting: mount on the supplied wall bracket with the carrying handle about 1 m above finished floor, on an escape route and clear of the hazard it protects. Keep the safety pin sealed until use. Inspect the gauge monthly — the needle must sit in the green band — and have the unit inspected every 12 months. Hydraulic re-testing is due every 3 years, and the extinguisher must be refilled after any discharge, however brief. Powder residue is non-conductive but fine, and needs vacuuming and wiping afterwards.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne charged 4 kg extinguisher with hose and pressure gauge, a wall-mounting bracket, a sealed safety pin and the instruction manual, in a single corrugated carton.','[{\"key\": \"extinguishing_agent\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Extinguishing agent\", \"value\": \"Mono ammonium phosphate (MAP 90)\"}, {\"key\": \"capacity_kg\", \"unit\": \"kg\", \"label\": \"Capacity\", \"value\": \"4 kg\"}, {\"key\": \"suitable_fire_classes\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Fire classes covered\", \"value\": \"Class A, Class B, Class C and electrically started fires\"}, {\"key\": \"fire_rating\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Fire rating\", \"value\": \"4A 144B (IS 15683); 21A 144B (EN 3)\"}, {\"key\": \"discharge_time_s\", \"unit\": \"s\", \"label\": \"Discharge time\", \"value\": \"15 s\"}, {\"key\": \"is_standard\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Indian Standard\", \"value\": \"IS 15683\"}, {\"key\": \"discharge_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Discharge range\", \"value\": \"2 m\"}, {\"key\": \"working_pressure_bar\", \"unit\": \"bar\", \"label\": \"Working pressure\", \"value\": \"15 bar\"}]','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"extinguishing_agent\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Extinguishing agent\", \"value\": \"Mono ammonium phosphate (MAP 90)\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"capacity_kg\", \"unit\": \"kg\", \"label\": \"Capacity\", \"value\": 4, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"CF-001144\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"operating_mechanism\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Operating mechanism\", \"value\": \"Stored pressure\", \"compare\": true, \"d