: 26, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 28}}','{\"title\": \"Ceasefire 4 kg ABC MAP 90 Fire Extinguisher\", \"keywords\": [\"ceasefire fire extinguisher 4 kg\", \"abc dry powder fire extinguisher\", \"map 90 extinguisher\", \"IS 15683 fire extinguisher\", \"stored pressure fire extinguisher\", \"fire extinguisher price hyderabad\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"अग्निशामक यंत्र 4 किलो\", \"एबीसी ड्राई पाउडर अग्निशामक\", \"सीजफायर फायर एक्सटिंग्विशर\", \"आईएस 15683 अग्निशामक यंत्र\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"అగ్నిమాపక యంత్రం 4 కేజీ\", \"ఏబీసీ డ్రై పౌడర్ అగ్నిమాపకం\", \"సీజ్‌ఫైర్ అగ్నిమాపక యంత్రం\", \"ఐఎస్ 15683 అగ్నిమాపకం\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"extinguishing_agent\", \"capacity_kg\", \"suitable_fire_classes\", \"fire_rating\", \"discharge_time_s\", \"discharge_range_m\", \"working_pressure_bar\", \"is_standard\"], \"meta_description\": \"Ceasefire CF-001144 ABC MAP 90 4 kg stored-pressure extinguisher. 4A 144B, 15 bar, IS 15683 and EN 3 certified, 10-year warranty. Ships across AP.\"}','skus/03/FIR-CEA-MAP90-4KG/img/1-card.webp','LbO3X^%g?^sA.7ofRQRjyrsUZ~X8',4.3,'https://www.ceasefire.in/product-page/abc-powder-portable-map-90-extinguishers','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 0, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.171Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 26, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 28}}','2026-08-22 07:52:10','2026-08-25 09:18:51',2,NULL),(20,20,'FIR-NEW-CA-EB-01','300 x 800 x 300 mm, single extinguisher',NULL,5200.00,'estimated',NULL,'No price is published by NewAge — supply is project-quoted. Typical Hyderabad rate for a mild-steel single-extinguisher cabinet of this size, Aug 2026, +/-25%.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','NewAge CA-EB-01 mild-steel cabinet for one portable extinguisher, 300 x 800 x 300 mm. Not an extinguisher — see listing note.','## What it is\n\nThe NewAge Extinguisher Box CA-EB-01 is a wall cabinet that houses one portable fire extinguisher. It measures 300 mm wide by 800 mm high by 300 mm deep and is built in mild steel; the same CA-EB range is also offered in stainless steel, FRP and polyethylene for corrosive and coastal locations, and in two-extinguisher sizes (CA-EB-02 and CA-EB-04, 600 mm wide).\n\n**Listing note:** this is an enclosure, not an extinguisher. NewAge Fire Protection Industries manufactures fire-protection systems and hardware and does not make portable fire extinguishers, so no NewAge extinguisher exists to list under this brand.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nAn extinguisher mounted in the open on a factory wall, a jetty, a car park or an outdoor plant area gets sun, rain, dust and knocks, and the label and gauge stop being readable long before the cylinder fails. The cabinet gives the appliance environmental protection while keeping it visible and reachable, which is what IS 2190 requires of any housed first-aid fire appliance.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nInternal capacity is a single extinguisher. The steel is powder coated over a pre-treated surface for corrosion resistance, and the cabinet is normally supplied in signal red so it reads as fire equipment at a distance. NewAge itself is ISO 9001:2015 certified and holds BIS certification for couplings and branch pipes, landing valves and water-foam monitors; there is no published BIS or ISI licence for the extinguisher box, and none is claimed here.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nFix the cabinet on an escape route with the housed extinguisher\'s carrying handle about 1 m above finished floor, per IS 2190. Keep the door unlocked or fitted with break-glass, never padlocked. Inspect at the same 12-month interval as the extinguisher it holds, and check the coating for rust bloom in coastal Andhra locations. The cabinet itself carries no extinguishing capability, so it must never be counted toward a building\'s extinguisher provision.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne CA-EB-01 cabinet body with door and fixings. The extinguisher is not included.','[{\"key\": \"is_standard\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Indian Standard\", \"value\": \"IS 2190 — code of practice for selection, installation and maintenance of portable first-aid fire appliances (housing and siting)\"}, {\"key\": \"suitable_for_electrical\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Safe on live electrical fires\", \"value\": \"No\"}, {\"key\": \"isi_marked\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"ISI marked\", \"value\": \"No\"}, {\"key\": \"warranty_months\", \"unit\": \"months\", \"label\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"12 months\"}, {\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"CA-EB-01\"}, {\"key\": \"cylinder_material\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cylinder material\", \"value\": \"Welded mild steel (EN 10120)\"}, {\"key\": \"dim_w_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Width / cylinder diameter\", \"value\": \"300 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"dim_h_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Overall height\", \"value\": \"800 mm\"}]','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 30, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"CA-EB-01\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Product identity\", \"importance\": 1}, {\"key\": \"performance\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"suitable_for_electrical\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Safe on live electrical fires\", \"value\": false, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"boolean\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Extinguishing performance\", \"importance\": 2}, {\"key\": \"composition\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"cylinder_material\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cylinder material\", \"value\": \"Welded mild steel (EN 10120)\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"hose_material\", \"unit