sher\", \"IS 15683 extinguisher\", \"MAP 40 dry powder extinguisher\", \"warehouse fire extinguisher\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"सेफेक्स अग्निशामक यंत्र\", \"6 किलो एबीसी फायर एक्सटिंग्विशर\", \"आईएसआई मार्क अग्निशामक\", \"गोदाम अग्निशामक यंत्र\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"సేఫెక్స్ అగ్నిమాపక యంత్రం\", \"6 కేజీ ఏబీసీ అగ్నిమాపకం\", \"ఐఎస్‌ఐ మార్క్ అగ్నిమాపక యంత్రం\", \"గోదాము అగ్నిమాపకం\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"extinguishing_agent\", \"capacity_kg\", \"suitable_fire_classes\", \"fire_rating\", \"discharge_time_s\", \"discharge_range_m\", \"working_pressure_bar\", \"is_standard\"], \"meta_description\": \"Safex 6 kg ABC stored-pressure extinguisher, ISI marked to IS 15683. 4A:55B rating, 25 s discharge, 6 m jet range, MS body. Ships across AP and Telangana.\"}','skus/8a/FIR-SAF-ABC-SP-6KG/img/1-card.webp','LbS6DF%M_Ns:-;WBRQt7tRWBRPt7',4.3,'https://safexfire.com/product/6kg-abc-portable-stored-pressure/','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 0, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.193Z\", \"placeholders\": 1, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 18, \"verified\": 4, \"ai_filled\": 32}}','2026-08-22 07:52:19','2026-08-25 09:18:51',2,NULL),(22,22,'SOL-ADA-ASB-M10-144-575','575 Wp · 144 half-cut n-type cells · dual glass',15800.00,12300.00,'estimated',NULL,'Adani publishes no MRP or retail price on adanisolar.com. Estimated at about ₹21.4/Wp for non-DCR n-type TOPCon, benchmarked against Waaree\'s own published ₹21.1/Wp retail rate for a comparable bifacial module in Aug 2026; typical Hyderabad / Vijayawada d','2026-08-22 00:00:00',5.00,1,'panel',1.000,'in_stock','575 Wp Adani ELAN Shine n-type TOPCon bifacial dual-glass module, 22.3% efficient, 144 half-cut cells, 12-yr product and 30-yr power warranty.','## What it is\n\nThe Adani Solar ASB-M10-144-575 is a 575 Wp glass-to-glass bifacial module from the ELAN Shine TOPCon Gen-II range, built from 144 half-cut M10 n-type bifacial cells with multi-busbar interconnection. Both faces are glass — 2.0 mm anti-reflective coated high-transmission glass in front, 2.0 mm semi-tempered glass behind — laminated with a high volume-resistivity, low-MVTR encapsulant. At 22.3% module efficiency it is the most efficient of the three flagship panels in this catalogue.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nUtility-scale ground-mounted plants and large commercial and industrial rooftops, where the higher efficiency means fewer modules, less structure and less cable for the same plant size. N-type cells hold their output better in the heat of the Deccan summer and carry no light-induced degradation loss, so the first-year drop is smaller than on a P-type module.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAt STC the module gives 575 Wp at 43.78 V and 13.14 A, with 52.3 V open-circuit and 13.89 A short-circuit. Power tolerance is 0 to +4.99 Wp. Temperature coefficients are −0.32 %/°C on power and −0.24 %/°C on Voc, with NOCT at 45 °C and an operating range of −40 °C to +85 °C. Maximum system voltage is 1500 V and the maximum series fuse rating is 30 A. The laminate is rated for 3600 Pa downward and 1600 Pa upward load at a design safety factor of 1.5. The panel measures 2278 mm × 1133 mm × 30 mm and weighs 33.5 kg. The IP68 junction box feeds 300 mm leads terminated in MC4-compatible connectors. Approvals listed on the datasheet cover IEC 61215, IEC 61730, IEC 61701 salt mist, IEC 62716 ammonia and IEC 60068-2-68 sand and dust, alongside BIS registration.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nBolt it through the frame mounting holes or clamp it to the rail, keeping within the 3600 Pa / 1600 Pa load ratings. Note the higher 52.3 V open-circuit voltage — check string length against the 1500 V system limit and against your inverter\'s cold-morning window. Leave clearance and a light-coloured surface behind the array to collect the rear-side gain. At 33.5 kg it is a two-person lift.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne 575 Wp module with junction box, 300 mm leads and MC4-compatible connectors fitted. Structure, clamps, earthing hardware and DC cable are supplied separately. Warranty: 12 years on product, 30 years on performance, with degradation under 1.0% in the first year and under 0.40% a year thereafter, reaching 87.4% of rated power at year 30.','[{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": \"575 Wp\"}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": \"22.3 %\"}, {\"key\": \"cell_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cell technology\", \"value\": \"N-type TOPCon\"}, {\"key\": \"performance_warranty_years\", \"unit\": \"years\", \"label\": \"Performance warranty\", \"value\": \"30 years\"}, {\"key\": \"voc_v\", \"unit\": \"V\", \"label\": \"Open-circuit voltage (Voc)\", \"value\": \"52.3 V\"}, {\"key\": \"isc_a\", \"unit\": \"A\", \"label\": \"Short-circuit current (Isc)\", \"value\": \"13.89 A\"}, {\"key\": \"fill_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Fill factor\", \"value\": \"0.792\"}, {\"key\": \"temp_coefficient_pmax\", \"unit\": \"%/°C\", \"label\": \"Temperature coefficient of Pmax\", \"value\": \"-0.32 %/°C\"}]','{\"total\": 56, \"filled\": 56, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": 575, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": 22.3, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"cell_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cell technology\", \"value\": \"N-type TOPCon\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"bifacial\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Bifacial (generates from the rear too)