": \"Adani Solar 575W TOPCon Bifacial Panel ASB-M10-144\", \"keywords\": [\"adani solar 575w panel\", \"adani topcon solar module\", \"elan shine topcon\", \"n type bifacial solar panel india\", \"575 wp solar panel price\", \"adani solar panel hyderabad\", \"asb-m10-144-575\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"अडानी सोलर पैनल\", \"575 वाट सोलर पैनल कीमत\", \"टॉपकॉन सोलर मॉड्यूल\", \"एन टाइप बाइफेशियल पैनल\", \"अडानी सोलर 575w\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"అదానీ సోలార్ ప్యానెల్\", \"575 వాట్ సోలార్ ప్యానెల్\", \"టాప్‌కాన్ సోలార్ మాడ్యూల్\", \"ఎన్ టైప్ బైఫేషియల్ ప్యానెల్\", \"సోలార్ ప్యానెల్ ధర తెలంగాణ\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"rated_power_wp\", \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"cell_technology\", \"voc_v\", \"isc_a\", \"fill_factor\", \"temp_coefficient_pmax\", \"performance_warranty_years\"], \"meta_description\": \"Adani ELAN Shine TOPCon 575 Wp n-type bifacial dual-glass solar panel — 22.3% efficient, 144 half-cut cells, 12-yr product and 30-yr power warranty.\"}','skus/7b/SOL-ADA-ASB-M10-144-575/img/1-card.webp','L6C?ipMxbv4n~qt79F?b_3-;8_-;',4.3,'https://www.adanisolar.com/product-topcon-shine-series','{\"total\": 56, \"filled\": 56, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 1, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.205Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 43, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 12}}','2026-08-22 07:52:24','2026-08-25 09:18:51',3,NULL),(23,23,'SOL-VIK-PARADEA-550','550 Wp · 144 half-cut cells · bifacial glass-glass',15000.00,11600.00,'estimated',NULL,'Vikram Solar publishes no MRP or retail price on vikramsolar.com. Estimated at about ₹21.1/Wp, benchmarked against Waaree\'s own published retail rate for a comparable 545 Wp bifacial module in Aug 2026; typical Hyderabad / Vijayawada distributor rate, ±10','2026-08-22 00:00:00',5.00,1,'panel',1.000,'in_stock','550 Wp Vikram Solar Paradea bifacial glass-glass Mono PERC module, 21.29% efficient, IS 14286 certified, 45 mm hail tested, 30-year power warranty.','## What it is\n\nThe Vikram Solar Paradea VSMDH.72.550.05 is a 550 Wp bifacial glass-glass module built from 72 Mono PERC P-type bifacial cells cut into 144 half-cells on the M10 format and joined with multi-busbar ribbons. Both faces are glass — 2.0 mm anti-reflective coated semi-tempered low-iron glass in front, 2.0 mm heat-strengthened low-iron glass behind — laminated with an EVA/EPE encapsulant inside an anodised aluminium frame of twin-wall section. Module efficiency at standard test conditions is 21.29%.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nCommercial and industrial rooftops, institutional campuses and ground-mounted plants, including single-axis trackers — the frame carries dedicated tracker holes as well as installing and grounding holes. A DCR-content version of this model is offered, which matters for subsidy-linked rooftop work in Andhra Pradesh and Telangana.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAt STC the module delivers 550 Wp at 41.9 V and 13.14 A, with 49.7 V open-circuit and 13.82 A short-circuit, at a power tolerance of 0 to +3%. Temperature coefficients are −0.35 %/°C on power and −0.27 %/°C on Voc, NOCT is 45 °C ± 2 °C and the operating range is −40 °C to +85 °C. Maximum system voltage is 1500 V with a 25 A maximum series fuse. The laminate is rated for 5400 Pa of snow load and 2400 Pa of wind load and has passed a 45 mm hail test at impact velocities up to 27 m/s at a third-party laboratory. It measures 2278 mm × 1134 mm × 30 mm and weighs 32.5 kg. The IP68 split junction box carries individual bypass diodes and MC4-compatible leads. Certification covers IS 14286:2010 / IEC 61215:2005 and IS/IEC 61730 Parts 1 and 2, plus IEC 61701 salt mist, IEC 62716 ammonia and IEC 60068-2-68 sand and dust.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nFix it through the eight 9 × 14 mm installing holes; four Ø4 mm grounding holes and four 7 × 10 mm tracker holes are provided in the frame. Earth every module at a grounding hole. Being bifacial, it wants clearance and a reflective surface behind the array. Check string length against the 1500 V limit and the 49.7 V open-circuit voltage. At 32.5 kg it is a two-person lift.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne 550 Wp module with split junction box, cables and MC4-compatible connectors fitted. Structure, clamps, earthing hardware and DC cable are supplied separately; modules ship 36 to a pallet. Warranty: 12 years on product, 30 years linear on power, with 2% first-year degradation and 0.5% a year thereafter, reaching 83.5% of rated power at year 30.','[{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": \"550 Wp\"}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": \"21.29 %\"}, {\"key\": \"cell_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cell technology\", \"value\": \"Mono PERC\"}, {\"key\": \"performance_warranty_years\", \"unit\": \"years\", \"label\": \"Performance warranty\", \"value\": \"30 years\"}, {\"key\": \"voc_v\", \"unit\": \"V\", \"label\": \"Open-circuit voltage (Voc)\", \"value\": \"49.7 V\"}, {\"key\": \"isc_a\", \"unit\": \"A\", \"label\": \"Short-circuit current (Isc)\", \"value\": \"13.82 A\"}, {\"key\": \"fill_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Fill factor\", \"value\": \"0.802\"}, {\"key\": \"temp_coefficient_pmax\", \"unit\": \"%/°C\", \"label\": \"Temperature coefficient of Pmax\", \"value\": \"-0.35 %/°C\"}]','{\"total\": 56, \"filled\": 56, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": 550, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": 21.29, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"cell_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cell technology\", \"value\": \"M