confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"warranty_months\", \"unit\": \"months\", \"label\": \"Product warranty\", \"value\": 144, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Warranty & service\", \"importance\": 5}], \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 45, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 10}}','{\"title\": \"Vikram Solar Paradea 550W Bifacial Panel Price\", \"keywords\": [\"vikram solar 550w panel\", \"vikram paradea solar module\", \"bifacial glass glass solar panel\", \"550 watt solar panel price india\", \"mono perc bifacial module\", \"vikram solar panel andhra pradesh\", \"is 14286 solar module\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"विक्रम सोलर पैनल\", \"550 वाट सोलर पैनल कीमत\", \"बाइफेशियल ग्लास सोलर पैनल\", \"मोनो पर्क मॉड्यूल\", \"विक्रम पैराडिया सोलर\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"విక్రమ్ సోలార్ ప్యానెల్\", \"550 వాట్ సోలార్ ప్యానెల్ ధర\", \"బైఫేషియల్ గ్లాస్ సోలార్ ప్యానెల్\", \"మోనో పెర్క్ మాడ్యూల్\", \"సోలార్ ప్యానెల్ ఆంధ్రప్రదేశ్\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"rated_power_wp\", \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"cell_technology\", \"voc_v\", \"isc_a\", \"fill_factor\", \"temp_coefficient_pmax\", \"performance_warranty_years\"], \"meta_description\": \"Vikram Solar Paradea 550 Wp bifacial glass-glass Mono PERC panel — 21.29% efficient, IS 14286 certified, 45 mm hail tested, 30-year power warranty.\"}','skus/f7/SOL-VIK-PARADEA-550/img/1-card.webp','L26kbX4n-oIVx]ofayt7_NM{oLWB',4.3,'https://www.vikramsolar.com/pv-modules/paradea/paradea-540-565w-144-cell/','{\"total\": 56, \"filled\": 56, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 1, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.217Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 1, \"fetched\": 45, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 10}}','2026-08-22 07:52:26','2026-08-25 09:18:51',3,NULL),(24,24,'SOL-WAA-BI55-545','545 Wp · 144 half-cut cells · framed dual glass',14907.00,11499.00,'fetched','https://shop.waaree.com/waaree-545wp-144cells-framed-dual-glass-mono-perc-bifacial-solar-module/','Manufacturer\'s own online store price, read 22 Aug 2026. MRP ₹14,907.11 rounded to ₹14,907. Works out to about ₹21.1 per Wp.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',5.00,1,'panel',1.000,'in_stock','545 Wp Waaree bifacial dual-glass Mono PERC module, 144 half-cut cells, 21.17% efficient, 12-year product and 30-year power warranty.','## What it is\n\nThe Waaree Bi-55-545 is a 545 Wp framed dual-glass bifacial solar module from Waaree\'s AHNAY Series, built from 144 half-cut M10 Mono PERC bifacial cells (91 × 182 mm) laid out 12×6 || 12×6 and interconnected with multi-busbar ribbons. Instead of a polymer backsheet it uses a second sheet of 2 mm low-iron printed semi-tempered glass, so the rear face also collects light. Module efficiency at standard test conditions is 21.17%.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nGrid-tied rooftop solar on houses, apartment blocks and commercial buildings, and ground-mounted captive plants where the reflected light off a light-coloured roof or hardstanding can be turned into extra output. The glass-glass sandwich is the more durable of the two common constructions, which is why it carries a 30-year power-output warranty rather than the usual 25.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAt STC the module delivers 545 Wp at 41.9 V and 13.02 A, with an open-circuit voltage of 49.76 V and a short-circuit current of 13.9 A. Maximum system voltage is 1500 V and the maximum series fuse rating is 25 A. Temperature coefficients are −0.34 %/°C on power and −0.25 %/°C on Voc, with NOCT at 43 °C and an operating range of −40 °C to +85 °C. The laminate is rated for 5400 Pa of front load and 2400 Pa of rear load. The panel measures 2272 mm tall × 1133 mm wide × 35 mm deep and weighs 32.5 kg. The IP68 weatherproof PPO junction box carries three bypass diodes and 500 mm of 4 mm² cable ending in IP68 MC4-compatible connectors.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nIt bolts to the mounting structure through eight 14 × 9 mm holes in the frame; clamp mounting is permitted per Waaree\'s installation manual. Because it is bifacial, leave clearance behind the array and avoid dark or shaded backgrounds if you want the rear-side gain. At 32.5 kg and 2.27 m long it is a two-person lift. Check string length against the 1500 V system limit and the 49.76 V open-circuit voltage before wiring.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne 545 Wp module with pre-attached junction box, cables and MC4-compatible connectors. Mounting structure, clamps, earthing hardware and cable are not included. Warranty: 12 years on product and workmanship, 30 years on power output, with 82.05% of rated power guaranteed at year 30.','[{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": \"545 Wp\"}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": \"21.17 %\"}, {\"key\": \"cell_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Cell technology\", \"value\": \"Mono PERC\"}, {\"key\": \"performance_warranty_years\", \"unit\": \"years\", \"label\": \"Performance warranty\", \"value\": \"30 years\"}, {\"key\": \"voc_v\", \"unit\": \"V\", \"label\": \"Open-circuit voltage (Voc)\", \"value\": \"49.76 V\"}, {\"key\": \"isc_a\", \"unit\": \"A\", \"label\": \"Short-circuit current (Isc)\", \"value\": \"13.9 A\"}, {\"key\": \"fill_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Fill factor\", \"value\": \"0.789\"}, {\"key\": \"temp_coefficient_pmax\", \"unit\": \"%/°C\", \"label\": \"Temperature coefficient of Pmax\", \"value\": \"-0.34 %/°C\"}]','{\"total\": 56, \"filled\": 56, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"rated_power_wp\", \"unit\": \"Wp\", \"label\": \"Rated power (STC)\", \"value\": 545, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"module_efficiency_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Module efficiency\", \"value\": 2