awada dealer counter rate for a 600x1200 mm Marbonite polished vitrified tile in August 2026 is ₹70-90 per sqft; at 15.5 sqft per box that is roughly ₹1,085-1,395 per box. ±10%.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'box',1.000,'in_stock','Johnson Marbonite Elite Floral Crema, 600x1200 mm polished vitrified tile from the StainFree series, 2 tiles per box covering 1.44 sqm.','## What it is\n\nFloral Crema (article YK1FLCR000000PJ) is a polished vitrified tile from Elite DSF RT24, the 600 x 1200 mm collection of Marbonite by Johnson. Johnson describes the Marbonite StainFree series as fully vitrified and easy on maintenance; the tile is a dry-pressed porcelain body in a cream marble design, 9 mm thick.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nJohnson lists the application as floor and wall, which is how the 2 x 4 ft format is used across Andhra Pradesh and Telangana - a continuous polished floor through living, dining and bedroom areas, with the same tile carried up a feature wall. PEI IV abrasion and a vitrified body cover domestic traffic and light-commercial interiors such as offices and showrooms. With an R9 slip class and a polished face this is an indoor, dry-area tile - not for balconies, terraces or open parking.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nThe body is Group BIa vitrified porcelain with water absorption at or below 0.5%, the property behind both the stain tolerance and the dimensional stability a 1200 mm tile needs. Breaking strength is taken at 1300 N with a modulus of rupture of 35 N/mm², to IS 15622 and the ISO 10545 test series, surface hardness around MOHS 6 and stain resistance Class 5. Dimensional tolerance is held to 0.6%, so the rectified edge closes on a 2 mm joint. The StainFree surface is the range\'s own low-maintenance polished face.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nFix thin-bed over a levelled, fully cured screed using a polymer-modified adhesive to IS 15477 - Ardex Endura, the group\'s own adhesive brand, is the matched product. Back-butter each tile so nothing is hollow across the 1200 mm span, hold joints at 2 mm, and check the box batch before laying, since shade variation is V2.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne box holds 2 tiles covering 1.44 m² (about 15.5 sqft) and weighs about 31 kg. Sold by the box under HSN 6907 at 18% GST.','[{\"key\": \"pei_abrasion_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"PEI abrasion class\", \"value\": \"PEI IV\"}, {\"key\": \"water_absorption_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Water absorption\", \"value\": \"0.5 %\"}, {\"key\": \"surface_finish\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Surface finish\", \"value\": \"Polished\"}, {\"key\": \"coverage_per_box_sqft\", \"unit\": \"sqft\", \"label\": \"Coverage per box (sq ft)\", \"value\": \"15.5 sqft\"}, {\"key\": \"rectified\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Rectified edge\", \"value\": \"Yes\"}, {\"key\": \"dim_w_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Width\", \"value\": \"600 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"slip_resistance_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Slip resistance (R rating)\", \"value\": \"R9\"}, {\"key\": \"modulus_of_rupture_mpa\", \"unit\": \"N/mm²\", \"label\": \"Modulus of rupture\", \"value\": \"35 N/mm²\"}]','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"body_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Tile body\", \"value\": \"Vitrified (porcelain) body\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"iso_13006_group\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"ISO 13006 / IS 15622 group\", \"value\": \"BIa\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"rectified\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Rectified edge\", \"value\": true, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"boolean\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"series_name\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Collection / series\", \"value\": \"E