ies, cream marble look, 2 tiles per box (1.44 sqm). AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/76/TIL-JOH-YK1FLCR000000PJ/img/1-card.webp','LFRCM8^*o$?a~pWFfkjYWFa#kCt8',4.3,'https://www.hrjohnsonindia.com/product-elite-dsf-rt24-floral-crema-yk1flcr000000pj','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 2, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.239Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 9, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 42}}','2026-08-22 07:52:30','2026-08-25 09:18:51',5,NULL),(26,26,'TIL-SOM-T31F119001859102','600 x 1200 mm, full polished, box of 2 (15.5 sqft)',1350.00,1160.00,'estimated',NULL,'No price is published on the Somany product page. Typical Hyderabad dealer counter rate for a 600x1200 mm Duragres full-polished GVT in August 2026 is ₹65-85 per sqft; at 15.5 sqft per box that is roughly ₹1,010-1,320 per box. ±10%.','2026-08-22 00:00:00',18.00,1,'box',1.000,'in_stock','Somany Duragres Grande El Sedona Crema FP, 600x1200 mm full-polished glazed vitrified tile in cream marble, 2 tiles per box covering 15.5 sqft.','## What it is\n\nGrande El Sedona Crema FP (article T31F119001859102) is a glazed vitrified tile from Duragres, Somany\'s GVT range. It is a dry-pressed porcelain body carrying a digitally printed cream marble design under a full-polished glaze, in a rectified 600 x 1200 mm module, 9 mm thick.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nSomany lists it for bedrooms, living rooms and kitchens - the 2 x 4 ft format that a builder in Andhra Pradesh or Telangana specifies when the brief is a continuous polished marble-look floor with few joints. The same tile carries onto walls and feature panels so the veining reads as one surface. A PEI IV abrasion class and a vitrified body cover domestic traffic and light-commercial interiors. With an R9 slip class and a polished face it belongs indoors, in dry areas - not on balconies, terraces or open parking.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nThe body is Group BIa vitrified porcelain with water absorption at or below 0.5%, the property that keeps a polished large format stable and stain-tolerant. Breaking strength is taken at 1300 N and modulus of rupture at 35 N/mm², to IS 15622 and the ISO 10545 test series, with surface hardness around MOHS 6 and stain resistance Class 5. Dimensional tolerance is held to 0.6%, so rectified edges close on a 2 mm joint. Somany was the first tile maker in India to carry a BIS mark on glazed vitrified tiles, from the year Duragres production began, and was certified by the Green Building Council in the same year.\n\n## Application and installation notes\n\nFix thin-bed over a levelled, fully cured screed with a polymer-modified adhesive to IS 15477 - Somany\'s own EzyFix is the matched product. Back-butter each tile so nothing is hollow under a 1200 mm span, hold joints at 2 mm, and check the box batch before laying, since shade variation is V2.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne box holds 2 tiles covering 1.44 m² (about 15.5 sqft) and weighs about 31 kg. Sold by the box under HSN 6907 at 18% GST.','[{\"key\": \"pei_abrasion_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"PEI abrasion class\", \"value\": \"PEI IV\"}, {\"key\": \"water_absorption_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Water absorption\", \"value\": \"0.5 %\"}, {\"key\": \"surface_finish\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Surface finish\", \"value\": \"Polished\"}, {\"key\": \"coverage_per_box_sqft\", \"unit\": \"sqft\", \"label\": \"Coverage per box (sq ft)\", \"value\": \"15.5 sqft\"}, {\"key\": \"rectified\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Rectified edge\", \"value\": \"Yes\"}, {\"key\": \"dim_w_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Width\", \"value\": \"600 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"slip_resistance_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Slip resistance (R rating)\", \"value\": \"R9\"}, {\"key\": \"modulus_of_rupture_mpa\", \"unit\": \"N/mm²\", \"label\": \"Modulus of rupture\", \"value\": \"35 N/mm²\"}]','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": 