ce\", \"importance\": 5}], \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 26, \"verified\": 8, \"ai_filled\": 17}}','{\"title\": \"CP PLUS CP-USC-TA24L2C-L 2.4 MP Dual Light Bullet Camera\", \"keywords\": [\"cp plus 2.4mp bullet camera\", \"CP-USC-TA24L2C-L\", \"cp plus dual light camera price\", \"cp plus colour night vision camera\", \"outdoor cctv camera ip67\", \"cctv camera vijayawada\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"सीपी प्लस बुलेट कैमरा\", \"सीपी प्लस 2.4MP कैमरा कीमत\", \"डुअल लाइट सीसीटीवी कैमरा\", \"आउटडोर सीसीटीवी कैमरा\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"సీపీ ప్లస్ బుల్లెట్ కెమెరా\", \"సీపీ ప్లస్ 2.4MP కెమెరా ధర\", \"డ్యూయల్ లైట్ సీసీటీవీ కెమెరా\", \"అవుట్‌డోర్ సీసీటీవీ కెమెరా\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"resolution_mp\", \"form_factor\", \"image_sensor\", \"min_illumination_lux\", \"ir_range_m\", \"lens_focal_length_mm\", \"horizontal_field_of_view_deg\", \"ip_rating\"], \"meta_description\": \"CP PLUS CP-USC-TA24L2C-L 2.4 MP dual-light bullet: 20 m IR + 20 m warm light, built-in mic, IP67, 3.6 mm lens, 24-month warranty. Ships to AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/4f/CCT-CPP-USC-TA24L2C-L/img/1-card.webp','LKGlI+0000ay~q9Foft700xu_3of',4.3,'https://cpplusworld.com/cp-usc-ta24l2c-l','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 3, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.276Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 26, \"verified\": 8, \"ai_filled\": 17}}','2026-08-23 00:03:24','2026-08-25 09:18:51',4,NULL),(47,47,'CCT-DAH-HDW1200TRQP','S6 version, 3.6 mm lens, PAL (TRQP)',2499.00,1350.00,'estimated',NULL,'No Indian listing of the exact S6 model could be opened (Flipkart blocked the fetch; Moglix lists only the HAC-T1A21-U at ₹849). ₹1,350 is the typical Hyderabad dealer rate for a 2 MP Dahua Lite eyeball in Aug 2026, ±15%; MRP is the usual list-price ceili','2026-08-23 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Dahua 2 MP HDCVI quick-install eyeball, 3.6 mm lens, 30 m smart IR, 4-in-1 CVI/TVI/AHD/CVBS output, 12 V DC, IP50 dust-protected. Indoor or sheltered use.','## What it is\n\nThe Dahua HAC-HDW1200TRQ (ordering code DH-HAC-HDW1200TRQP for PAL) is the S6 version of Dahua\'s 2 MP Lite Series HDCVI eyeball camera. It is a white plastic turret, 97.1 mm across and 93 mm tall, weighing 0.14 kg, with a 3.6 mm fixed M12 lens that gives an 83° horizontal field of view. The body sits on a quick-to-install pedestal that screws straight to the surface. This base TRQP model has no microphone. It is rated IP50 — protected against dust but not against water — so it belongs indoors or under cover.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nIt is the workhorse camera for homes, shops, small offices, apartment corridors and godowns running on Dahua HDCVI or any 4-in-1 DVR. The single BNC output switches between CVI, TVI, AHD and CVBS, so it can replace an old analogue camera on the existing coaxial cable without changing the recorder.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nThe 2 MP progressive-scan CMOS sensor produces 1920 × 1080 video at up to 30 fps, with 960H output available on CVBS. Minimum illumination is 0.01 lux, and two smart-IR LEDs light the scene in black and white to about 30 m — further than most 2 MP cameras in this class. The bracket pans 360°, tilts 78° and rotates 360°. Power is 12 V DC at a maximum of 2.7 W. It is rated for −40 °C to 60 °C at up to 95% humidity. The datasheet lists IEC/EN 62368-1 safety and EN 55032/55035 and FCC Part 15B EMC compliance. Warranty is 24 months.\n\n## Installation notes\n\nFix the pedestal to a ceiling or wall at around 2.7 m, clip the eyeball on, and aim using the three adjustment axes. Keep it away from rain, splash and wash-down areas — IP50 is a dust rating only, and the camera is not rated for outdoor use. Run coaxial cable to the DVR and set the DVR channel to the CVI mode (or TVI/AHD for other recorders). Use a regulated 12 V DC supply sized for 2.7 W per camera. If sound recording is needed, specify the HAC-HDW1200TRQ-A variant instead.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne camera with quick-install pedestal, video and power pigtail, mounting screws and wall plugs, a drilling template and a quick start guide, in a single printed carton.','[{\"key\": \"resolution_mp\", \"unit\": \"MP\", \"label\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"2 MP\"}, {\"key\": \"form_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Body shape\", \"value\": \"Turret (eyeball)\"}, {\"key\": \"ir_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Night-vision (IR) range\", \"value\": \"30 m\"}, {\"key\": \"lens_focal_length_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Lens focal length\", \"value\": \"3.6 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"ip_rating\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Weather protection (IP) rating\", \"value\": \"Not rated (indoor)\"}, {\"key\": \"image_sensor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Image sensor\", \"value\": \"2 MP CMOS, progressive scan\"}, {\"key\": \"horizontal_field_of_view_deg\", \"unit\": \"°\", \"label\": \"Horizontal field of view\", \"value\": \"83 °\"}, {\"key\": \"min_illumination_lux\", \"unit\": \"lux\", \"label\": \"Minimum illumination\", \"value\": \"0.01 lux\"}]','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"resolution_mp\", \"unit\": \"MP\", \"label\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": 2, \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"number\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"form_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Body shape\", \"value\": \"Turret (eyeball)\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"signal_technology\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Signal technology\", \"value\": \"Multi-standard (TVI/AHD/CVI/CVBS)\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"night_vision_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Night vision\", \"value\": \"Infrared (black & white)\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"con