f_view_deg\", \"ip_rating\"], \"meta_description\": \"Dahua HAC-HDW1200TRQ 2 MP HDCVI quick-install eyeball camera, 3.6 mm lens, 30 m smart IR, 4-in-1 CVI/TVI/AHD/CVBS output. Delivery across AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/81/CCT-DAH-HDW1200TRQP/img/1-card.webp','L01p;xpJQ8kXX:fki_j[D4aepdkC',4.3,'https://www.dahuasecurity.com/products/All-Products/HDCVI-Cameras/Lite-Series/1080P/1080-P/HAC-HDW1200TRQ(-A)=S6','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 3, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.288Z\", \"placeholders\": 1, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 33, \"verified\": 0, \"ai_filled\": 18}}','2026-08-23 00:03:25','2026-08-25 09:18:51',4,NULL),(48,48,'CCT-HIK-2CE76D0T-ITPFS','3.6 mm lens, white',3999.00,1249.00,'fetched','https://www.amazon.in/dp/B099PZJGPQ','Amazon.in listing B099PZJGPQ (HIKVISION DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS 2MP Dome Camera with Mic) showed ₹1,249 on 2026-08-23. MRP ₹3,999 is the list price on the Moglix listing of the same model (selling ₹1,584, available on request). Hyderabad dealer rate is typicall','2026-08-23 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Hikvision 2 MP Turbo HD turret with built-in mic, 3.6 mm lens, 20 m infrared night vision, 4-in-1 TVI/AHD/CVI/CVBS output, 12 V DC. Indoor use.','## What it is\n\nThe Hikvision DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS is a 2 MP Turbo HD turret camera from the Value Series, fitted with a built-in microphone that sends audio down the same coaxial cable as the video. It is a compact white plastic turret, 84.6 mm across and 78.9 mm tall, weighing about 140 g, with a 3.6 mm fixed lens that gives a 79.6° horizontal field of view. It is an indoor model and carries no IP weather rating.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nThis is the camera installers reach for inside shops, offices, apartments, godowns and corridors when the client wants sound as well as pictures on an existing HD analogue DVR. The multi-standard output switches between TVI, AHD, CVI and CVBS, so it records on Hikvision Turbo HD DVRs and on most other HD analogue recorders already in the field, and it can replace an older CVBS camera without re-cabling.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nA 2 MP CMOS sensor delivers 1920 × 1080 video at up to 30 fps. Minimum illumination is 0.01 lux, and the infrared LEDs light the scene in black and white to about 20 m. The 3-axis bracket pans 360°, tilts 75° and rotates 360° for aiming. The camera runs from 12 V DC and draws a maximum of 2.7 W, and it is rated for −40 °C to 60 °C at up to 90% humidity, so a sealed Telangana shop in May is well inside its envelope. The Indian safety reference for cameras of this class is IS 13252 (Part 1) / IEC 62368-1, and the warranty is 24 months.\n\n## Installation notes\n\nMount on the ceiling or a wall at around 2.7 m, aim with the three adjustment axes, and keep it out of rain and direct water — it is not weather-sealed and is not rated for outdoor use. Run a single coaxial cable back to the DVR; the microphone audio travels on the same cable, so no separate audio line is needed. Power it from a regulated 12 V DC supply and enable audio on the matching DVR channel so that sound is recorded with the video.\n\n## What\'s in the box\n\nOne camera with its video and power pigtail, mounting screws and wall plugs, a drilling template and a quick start guide, packed in a single printed carton.','[{\"key\": \"resolution_mp\", \"unit\": \"MP\", \"label\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"2 MP\"}, {\"key\": \"form_factor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Body shape\", \"value\": \"Turret (eyeball)\"}, {\"key\": \"ir_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Night-vision (IR) range\", \"value\": \"20 m\"}, {\"key\": \"lens_focal_length_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Lens focal length\", \"value\": \"3.6 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"ip_rating\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Weather protection (IP) rating\", \"value\": \"Not rated (indoor)\"}, {\"key\": \"image_sensor\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Image sensor\", \"value\": \"2 MP CMOS\"}, {\"key\": \"horizontal