s in the camera electronics and lens module; excludes physical damage, water ingress, surge or lightning damage and accessories\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Warranty & service\", \"importance\": 5}], \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 26, \"verified\": 5, \"ai_filled\": 20}}','{\"title\": \"Hikvision DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS 2 MP Audio Turret Camera\", \"keywords\": [\"hikvision 2mp camera with audio\", \"DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS\", \"hikvision turret camera price\", \"hikvision dome camera with mic\", \"2mp cctv camera hyderabad\", \"turbo hd camera 4 in 1\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"हिकविजन 2MP सीसीटीवी कैमरा\", \"ऑडियो डोम कैमरा\", \"हिकविजन टरेट कैमरा कीमत\", \"सीसीटीवी कैमरा हैदराबाद\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"హిక్‌విజన్ 2MP సీసీటీవీ కెమెరా\", \"ఆడియో డోమ్ కెమెరా\", \"హిక్‌విజన్ టర్రెట్ కెమెరా ధర\", \"సీసీటీవీ కెమెరా హైదరాబాద్\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"resolution_mp\", \"form_factor\", \"image_sensor\", \"min_illumination_lux\", \"ir_range_m\", \"lens_focal_length_mm\", \"horizontal_field_of_view_deg\", \"ip_rating\"], \"meta_description\": \"Hikvision DS-2CE76D0T-ITPFS 2 MP indoor turret camera with built-in mic, 20 m IR night vision, 3.6 mm lens, 4-in-1 output. Delivery across AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/73/CCT-HIK-2CE76D0T-ITPFS/img/1-card.webp','LNHLl1IU00_3~qofM{of4n%MfQ9F',4.3,'https://www.hikvisionindia.com/products/camera-products/value-series/ds-2ce76d0t-itpfs/','{\"total\": 51, \"filled\": 51, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 1, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.301Z\", \"placeholders\": 3, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 26, \"verified\": 5, \"ai_filled\": 20}}','2026-08-23 00:03:25','2026-08-25 09:18:51',4,NULL),(49,49,'GLS-AIS-EDGE-NATURAPLUS','6 mm, Natura Plus (neutral), single glazing',110.00,95.00,'estimated',NULL,'Typical Hyderabad glass-dealer rate for AIS Ecosense Edge 6 mm coated glass, Aug 2026, ±15%. AIS publishes no MRP and its own IndiaMART listing shows the range out of stock without a price.','2026-08-23 00:00:00',18.00,1,'sqft',1.000,'in_stock','AIS Ecosense Edge Natura Plus 6 mm neutral coated glass for single glazing. VLT 45%, SHGC 0.42, U-value 4.6 W/m²K. Sold per sqft, cut to size.','## What it is\n\nAIS Ecosense Edge Natura Plus is a 6 mm coated glass from Asahi India Glass\'s Ecosense range, in the Edge sub-range that AIS developed for single-glazing use. A multilayer metal-oxide coating on clear soda-lime float glass gives the pane both solar control and a measure of thermal insulation, which is why it is grouped here as a low-emissivity glass; the neutral shade keeps the view colour-true. It is supplied as one annealed monolithic pane, so it is not a safety glass as delivered, and a processor can toughen or laminate it to IS 2553 Part 1 if required. At about 15 kg per square metre, a 1200 × 1800 mm pane weighs roughly 32 kg.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nWindows and residential glazing: large living-room sliders, bedroom windows and balcony glazing in houses and apartments across Andhra Pradesh and Telangana, and small façades and structural glazing on low-rise commercial buildings. It is rated for exterior use with the coated face to the interior; as supplied it is not meant for overhead glazing.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nFor the 6 mm single pane AIS publishes a visible light transmission of 45%, external reflection of 20%, a solar factor of 42% (SHGC 0.42) and a U-value of 4.6 W/m²K, computed to ISO 9050 for light and solar values and EN 673 for the U-value. Emissivity is estimated at about 0.4, UV transmission around 20% and sound reduction about 31 dB. Thermal-shock resistance is 40 °C and bending strength 41 MPa, the usual values for annealed float. The substrate is IS 14900 float glass; IS 2553 Part 1 applies only once toughened or laminated, and IS 16231 only if the pane is built into the 6-12-6 DGU configuration AIS also lists.\n\n## Installation notes\n\nGlaze with the coating on surface 2 — the inside face of the outer pane — in uPVC or aluminium frames or structural-glazing systems, with at least 12 mm edge engagement, setting blocks and neutral-cure silicone. The coated annealed pane can be cut to size at the dealer; handle the coated face with clean gloves, keep it dry in storage and do not use abrasive pads on it. Order toughened panes for doors, railings and oversized lights.\n\n## What\'s supplied\n\nCut-to-size panes with as-cut edges and the coated face marked, interleaved with paper or cork pads and delivered on an A-frame or in a wooden crate. Minimum order 10 sqft; typical lead time about 7 days through AIS processors in Hyderabad and Vijayawada. Warranty is recorded as 120 months on the coating, to be confirmed with the AIS dealer. HSN 7005, GST 18%.','[{\"key\": \"visible_light_transmission_pct\", \"unit\": \"%\", \"label\": \"Visible light transmission (VLT)\", \"value\": \"45 %\"}, {\"key\": \"light_to_solar_gain\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Light-to-solar-gain ratio\", \"value\": \"1.07\"}, {\"key\": \"solar_heat_gain_coefficient\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Solar heat gain coefficient (SHGC)\", \"value\": \"0.42\"}, {\"key\": \"u_value_w_m2k\", \"unit\": \"W/m²K\", \"label\": \"U-value (thermal transmittance)\", \"value\": \"4.6 W/m²K\"}, {\"key\": \"sound_reduction_db\", \"unit\": \"dB\", \"label\": \"Sound reduction index (Rw)\", \"value\": \"31 dB\"}, {\"key\": \"nominal_thickness_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Nominal thickness\", \"value\": \"6 mm\"}, {\"key\": \"impact_safety_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Impact safety class\", \"value\": \"Not a safety glass\"}, {\"key\": \"max_pane_width_mm\", \"unit\": \"mm\", \"label\": \"Maximum pane width\", \"value\": \"3,210 mm\"}]','{\"total\": 47, \"filled\": 47, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"glass_colour\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Colour / tint\", \"value\": \"Neutral / silver\", \"compare\": t