eat reflective glass hyderabad\", \"saint gobain window glass\"], \"keywords_hi\": [\"सेंट गोबेन सन बैन ग्लास\", \"सफायर ब्लू कांच 5 एमएम\", \"सोलर कंट्रोल खिड़की का कांच\", \"सनबैन ग्लास प्रति वर्ग फुट कीमत\"], \"keywords_te\": [\"సెయింట్ గోబెయిన్ సన్ బాన్ గ్లాస్\", \"సఫైర్ బ్లూ గాజు 5 ఎంఎం\", \"వేడి తగ్గించే కిటికీ గాజు\", \"సన్‌బాన్ గాజు ధర\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"visible_light_transmission_pct\", \"light_to_solar_gain\", \"solar_heat_gain_coefficient\", \"u_value_w_m2k\", \"sound_reduction_db\", \"impact_safety_class\", \"nominal_thickness_mm\", \"max_pane_width_mm\"], \"meta_description\": \"Saint-Gobain Sun Ban Sapphire Blue 5 mm solar-control glass: VLT 22.9%, SHGC 0.39, U 5.72 W/m²K, pyrolytic coat. Per sqft, cut to size, AP & Telangana.\"}','skus/2a/GLS-SGB-SUNBAN-SAPPHIRE5/img/1-card.webp','LcE3xTVr-ooz?wadxZofr=bbRkj?',4.3,'https://in.saint-gobain-glass.com/product/sgg-sapphire-blue','{\"total\": 47, \"filled\": 47, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 0, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.338Z\", \"placeholders\": 3, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 2, \"fetched\": 13, \"verified\": 1, \"ai_filled\": 31}}','2026-08-23 00:04:03','2026-08-25 09:18:51',6,NULL),(52,52,'TST-TRI-C5-2','2\" angular accuracy, optical or laser plummet',825000.00,825000.00,'fetched','https://www.indiamart.com/proddetail/trimble-c5-total-station-20139919097.html','IndiaMART listing by Allterra Solutions LLP, Gurugram (Trimble authorised distribution partner); accuracy class not stated on the listing (C5 is offered 1\"-5\"). Other Indian listings for the C5 / C5 HP run about 4.0-5.7 lakh (Aug 2026).','2026-08-23 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Trimble C5 2\" mechanical total station: 800 m reflectorless, 5,000 m to prism, Nikon autofocus optics, dual colour touchscreens, Trimble Access, IP66.','## What it is\n\nThe Trimble C5 is a mechanical (manual) total station built for Trimble by Nikon-Trimble in Japan, supplied here in the 2-second angular accuracy class. It pairs Nikon multi-coated optics with autofocus, a time-of-flight infrared EDM that is Class 1 laser-safe in both prism and reflectorless modes, and two 640 x 480 colour touchscreens - one on each face - running Trimble Access onboard on Windows Embedded Compact 7. The main unit weighs 4.3 kg and measures 206 x 169 x 318 mm.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nConstruction layout, road and rail earthworks, building surveys and boundary or topographic work where a crew wants a rugged, simple instrument whose job files flow straight into Trimble Business Center. Trimble Access gives stakeout and the usual survey routines from either face, so the operator never has to walk round the instrument.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAngular accuracy is 2\" (ISO 17123-3) from absolute encoders on 62 mm circles, with a dual-axis compensator of +/- 3\' range. To a prism the EDM measures +/- (2 mm + 2 ppm) out to 5,000 m; without a prism it reaches 800 m at +/- (3 mm + 2 ppm) in standard mode or +/- (10 mm + 5 ppm) in fast standard mode. The 30x telescope has a 45 mm objective, a 1°25\' field of view, 3\" resolving power and focuses from 1.5 m, with Nikon autofocus and four-step reticle illumination. Memory is 512 MB RAM plus 4 GB flash; connections are one RS-232C serial port, two USB ports, integrated Bluetooth and WLAN. Two hot-swappable 3.6 V Li-ion packs give about 12 hours of distance-and-angle work (14 hours angle-only, 7 hours continuous) and recharge in about 6 hours. The body is sealed to IP66 and rated from -20 °C to +50 °C.\n\n## Field notes\n\nChoose the optical-plummet model (3x, 0.5 m minimum focus) or the Class 2 laser-plummet model. Level on the tribrach\'s 10\'/2 mm circular vial, then on the electronic level. The user guide\'s checking-and-adjustment chapter covers the electronic and circular levels, the plummet, vertical zero-point and horizontal-angle corrections, the instrument constant and autofocus calibration - run it after transport. Both axes have clamps with tangent screws; the tripod thread is the standard 5/8-inch. The dealer warranty is typically 12 months, with extended plans available.\n\n## What\'s in the case\n\nInstrument main body with tribrach, two battery packs, battery charger and AC adapter, adjustment pin and Allen wrench, rain/dust cover, shoulder strap and USB cable, all in the 3.3 kg hard carrying case. A calibration certificate is normally supplied with a new instrument.','[{\"key\": \"angular_accuracy_arcsec\", \"unit\": \"arcsec\", \"label\": \"Angular accuracy\", \"value\": \"2 arcsec\"}, {\"key\": \"distance_accuracy_prism\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Distance accuracy (to prism)\", \"value\": \"+/- (2 mm + 2 ppm) standard mode (ISO 17123-4)\"}, {\"key\": \"prism_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Range to single prism\", \"value\": \"5,000 m\"}, {\"key\": \"reflectorless_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Reflectorless range\", \"value\": \"800 m\"}, {\"key\": \"compensator_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Compensator\", \"value\": \"Dual-axis\"}, {\"key\": \"battery_operating_time_h\", \"unit\": \"h\", \"label\": \"Battery operating time\", \"value\": \"12 h\"}, {\"key\": \"ip_rating\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"IP protection rating\", \"value\": \"IP66\"}, {\"key\": \"telescope_magnification_x\", \"unit\": \"x\", \"label\": \"Telescope magnification\", \"value\": \"30 x\"}]','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"instrument_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Instrument class\", \"value\": \"Manual total station\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"Trimble C5 2\\\"\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"onboard_software\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Onboard softwar