వే పరికరం ట్రింబుల్\"], \"key_specs_order\": [\"angular_accuracy_arcsec\", \"distance_accuracy_prism\", \"prism_range_m\", \"reflectorless_range_m\", \"compensator_type\", \"telescope_magnification_x\", \"battery_operating_time_h\", \"ip_rating\"], \"meta_description\": \"Trimble C5 2\\\" mechanical total station: autofocus, 800 m reflectorless, 5,000 m prism range, dual touchscreens, Trimble Access. Price for AP/Telangana.\"}','skus/04/TST-TRI-C5-2/img/1-card.webp','L77o_6p00HT3%%j]M|WC0qa#}*oJ',4.3,'https://geospatial.trimble.com/en/products/hardware/trimble-c5','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"images\": 5, \"brochures\": 3, \"computed_at\": \"2026-08-25T09:18:51.351Z\", \"placeholders\": 0, \"by_provenance\": {\"derived\": 0, \"fetched\": 21, \"verified\": 19, \"ai_filled\": 14}}','2026-08-23 00:04:43','2026-08-25 09:18:51',7,NULL),(53,53,'TST-TOP-GM-52','2\" angular accuracy, dual display, laser plummet',395000.00,395000.00,'fetched','https://www.indiamart.com/proddetail/topcon-gm-52-total-station-2849318657933.html','IndiaMART listing by Ocean Survey Instruments Tech, New Delhi, for the GM-52 2\". Other Indian listings for the GM-52 run about 3.5-3.95 lakh (Aug 2026).','2026-08-23 00:00:00',18.00,1,'piece',1.000,'in_stock','Topcon GM-52 2\" reflectorless total station: 500 m reflectorless, 4,000 m to prism, 30x, IP66 magnesium body, 50,000-point memory, 14 h battery.','## What it is\n\nThe Topcon GM-52 is the 2-second model of the GM-50 Series, a manual reflectorless total station with a magnesium-alloy housing, dual-face 192 x 80 dot graphic LCDs with 28-key illuminated keyboards, and Topcon\'s TopBasic onboard program. It weighs 5.1 kg with handle and battery and measures 183 x 181 x 348 mm.\n\n## What it\'s for\n\nTopcon positions the GM-50 Series as an entry-level site layout and survey tool: building construction, civil works, topographic and cadastral surveys. Stakeout routines are onboard, and Bluetooth lets the instrument work cable-free with MAGNET Field on a data collector, so a two-person crew can run layout without a cable to the controller.\n\n## Key specifications\n\nAngular accuracy is 2\" (ISO 17123-3:2001) from a rotary absolute encoder read on two sides, held by a liquid dual-axis tilt sensor with +/- 6\' range; IACS factory calibration keeps the angle system honest. The coaxial phase-shift EDM (690 nm red laser, Class 3R, Class 1-equivalent in prism mode) measures to 4,000 m on a standard prism at 1.5 mm + 2 ppm, and reflectorless to 500 m - 2 mm + 2 ppm to 200 m, 5 mm + 10 ppm to 350 m and 10 mm + 10 ppm to 500 m - with a 13 mm beam spot at 30 m. The 30x telescope with 45 mm objective has a 1°30\' field of view, 2.5\" resolving power and 1.3 m minimum focus. Internal memory holds about 50,000 points, and USB flash drives up to 32 GB plug into the Type-A port; RS-232C and Bluetooth Class 1.5 are also provided. The side-mounted BDC46C Li-ion battery (7.2 V, 2,430 mAh) runs about 14 hours in EDM eco mode (about 10 hours in normal fine mode) and charges in about 2.5 hours on the CDC68A charger. Protection is IP66; the operating range is -20 °C to +60 °C, with the instrument shaded above 50 °C.\n\n## Field notes\n\nThe Class 2 laser plummet holds 1 mm at 1.3 m tripod height; level on the 10\'/2 mm circular level and finish on the electronic circular level. After transport, check the levels, plummet, collimation, vertical index, tilt-sensor zero and EDM additive constant as the manual describes. The tripod thread is the standard 5/8-inch. The Indian dealer warranty is 12 months, and AMC or extended cover is available.\n\n## What\'s in the case\n\nGM-52 with tribrach, BDC46C battery and CDC68A charger, lens cap, tool kit, rain cover, instruction manual and the hard carrying case. A calibration certificate is normally supplied with a new instrument.','[{\"key\": \"angular_accuracy_arcsec\", \"unit\": \"arcsec\", \"label\": \"Angular accuracy\", \"value\": \"2 arcsec\"}, {\"key\": \"distance_accuracy_prism\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Distance accuracy (to prism)\", \"value\": \"(1.5 mm + 2 ppm x D) fine mode (ISO 17123-4:2012)\"}, {\"key\": \"prism_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Range to single prism\", \"value\": \"4,000 m\"}, {\"key\": \"reflectorless_range_m\", \"unit\": \"m\", \"label\": \"Reflectorless range\", \"value\": \"500 m\"}, {\"key\": \"compensator_type\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Compensator\", \"value\": \"Dual-axis\"}, {\"key\": \"battery_operating_time_h\", \"unit\": \"h\", \"label\": \"Battery operating time\", \"value\": \"14 h\"}, {\"key\": \"ip_rating\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"IP protection rating\", \"value\": \"IP66\"}, {\"key\": \"telescope_magnification_x\", \"unit\": \"x\", \"label\": \"Telescope magnification\", \"value\": \"30 x\"}]','{\"total\": 54, \"filled\": 54, \"groups\": [{\"key\": \"product_identity\", \"rows\": [{\"key\": \"instrument_class\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Instrument class\", \"value\": \"Manual total station\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"enum\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"fetched\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"model_number\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Model number\", \"value\": \"GM-52\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"verified\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"onboard_software\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Onboard software\", \"value\": \"TopBasic onboard program (no Windows or MAGNET onboard); pairs over Bluetooth with MAGNET Field on a data collector\", \"compare\": true, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"verified\", \"source_url\": null}, {\"key\": \"drive_system\", \"unit\": null, \"label\": \"Drives and clamps\", \"value\": \"Horizontal and vertical clamps with tangent screws\", \"compare\": false, \"data_type\": \"text\", \"confidence\": null, \"provenance\": \"ai_filled\", \"source_url\": null}], \"label\": \"Product identity\", \"importance\": 1}, {\"key\": \"meas